                            <path d=\"M128 130 L142 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M128 160 L142 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            
                            <path d=\"M128 70 L142 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M128 100 L142 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M128 130 L142 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M128 160 L142 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            
                            <path d=\"M128 70 L142 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M128 100 L142 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M128 130 L142 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M128 160 L142 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Ship/Boat Cargo -->
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"70\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"310\" y=\"50\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <path d=\"M280 100 L380 100 L360 140 L300 140 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Ship Connections to Brain -->
                            <path d=\"M280 120 C250 130, 250 150, 230 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M380 120 C400 130, 300 100, 240 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Deep learning neural networks are inspired by the structure and function of the human brain, using interconnected layers of artificial neurons.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>Have you ever wondered how the human brain works? How do we learn? Neural networks in deep learning attempt to simulate this process through interconnected layers of artificial neurons, each building on the insights of the previous layer.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>Neurons and Layers</h3>
                        <p>In artificial neural networks, each \"neuron\" is a simple mathematical function that takes multiple inputs, applies weights to them, and produces an output. What makes a neural network \"deep\" is the presence of multiple layers between the input and output:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Input Layer:</strong> Receives the raw data (like pixels in an image)</li>
                            <li><strong>Hidden Layers:</strong> Process the information through multiple transformations</li>
                            <li><strong>Output Layer:</strong> Provides the final result (like a classification)</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>The more hidden layers a network has, the \"deeper\" it is, and the more complex patterns it can learn.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"learning-process\">
                    <h2>How Deep Learning Models Learn</h2>
                    <p>Think back to when you were a child. You probably played games that involved image recognition at school. Remember those cards? You would decide if it was a dog or a cat, and your teacher would confirm. Learning happened through repetition and feedback.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Classroom Setting -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Whiteboard -->
                            <rect x=\"65\" y=\"60\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Animal Pictures on Whiteboard -->
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"70\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <!-- Eye -->
                            <circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle> <!-- Face -->
                            <path d=\"M85 78 L90 73\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Ear -->
                            <path d=\"M105 78 L100 73\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Ear -->
                            <path d=\"M95 90 L95 95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Mouth -->
                            
                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"70\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"80\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <!-- Eye -->
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"80\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <!-- Eye -->
                            <path d=\"M135 85 L135 80 L140 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Snout -->
                            <path d=\"M130 90 L140 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Mouth -->
                            
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"120\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <!-- Eye -->
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"120\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <!-- Eye -->
                            <path d=\"M95 125 L95 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Beak -->
                            <path d=\"M85 115 L105 115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Wings -->
                            
                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"125\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle> <!-- Face -->
                            <path d=\"M130 120 L140 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Eyes -->
                            <path d=\"M135 130 C140 133, 130 133, 135 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Smile -->
                            
                            <!-- Teacher -->
                            <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"90\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"185\" y=\"105\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"195\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"195\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"205\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Student -->
                            <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"110\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"247\" y=\"120\" width=\"6\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"247\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"253\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"247\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"242\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"253\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <rect x=\"245\" y=\"100\" width=\"10\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#666\"></rect> <!-- Cap -->
                            
                            <!-- Computer Learning Process -->
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"305\" y=\"75\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"310\" y=\"80\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"312\" y=\"88\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#FFF\">70%</text>
                            
                            <path d=\"M300 110 L340 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"120\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"305\" y=\"125\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"310\" y=\"130\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"312\" y=\"138\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#FFF\">95%</text>
                            
                            <!-- Arrows -->
                            <path d=\"M320 100 L320 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"320,120 317,115 323,115\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Deep learning models learn through repeated exposure to examples, gradually improving their accuracy, similar to how children learn to recognize images.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>This is similar to how a computer learns. The neural network makes assumptions and can be, let\'s say, 70% certain that the image is correct or not. Instead of guessing, it adjusts its parameters and retrains over time.</p>
                    
                    <p>By leveraging this data and recognizing the unique impacts of various inputs, AI is enhancing its predictive capabilities. The more high-quality data the computer has to train on, the more accurate it will be at recognizing patterns.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"cooking-analogy\">
                    <h2>The Cooking Analogy</h2>
                    <p>Let\'s think about cooking to understand the difference between traditional machine learning and deep learning.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"250\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 250\">
                            <!-- Simple Cooking (Traditional ML) -->
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"93\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"107\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M90 100 L110 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <text x=\"75\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Frying an Egg</text>
                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">(Simple ML)</text>
                            
                            <!-- Rice Cooking (Traditional ML) -->
                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"80\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"205\" y=\"85\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"100\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M218 97 L222 97\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M217 100 L223 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M218 103 L222 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <text x=\"175\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Cooking Rice</text>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">(Simple ML)</text>
                            
                            <!-- Complex Cooking (Deep Learning) -->
                            <path d=\"M300 90 C320 70, 340 90, 340 110 L300 110 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M300 110 L340 110 L340 120 L300 120 Z\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"105\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"105\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Fried Chicken</text>
                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">(Deep Learning)</text>
                            
                            <!-- Cooking Steps for Deep Learning -->
                            <rect x=\"75\" y=\"180\" width=\"250\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Steps -->
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"200\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"97\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFF\">1</text>
                            <text x=\"115\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Breading</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"200\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"162\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFF\">2</text>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Temperature</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"200\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"232\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFF\">3</text>
                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Oil Type</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"230\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"97\" y=\"234\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFF\">4</text>
                            <text x=\"115\" y=\"234\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Timing</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"230\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"162\" y=\"234\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFF\">5</text>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"234\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Seasoning</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"230\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"232\" y=\"234\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFF\">6</text>
                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"234\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Resting</text>
                            
                            <!-- Chef Tools -->
                            <rect x=\"350\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"355\" y=\"100\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"85\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            
                            <path d=\"M350 190 L355 180 L365 180 L370 190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <rect x=\"350\" y=\"190\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">The complexity of deep learning compared to traditional machine learning is like comparing cooking a complex dish with many variables to simple cooking tasks.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>From Simple to Complex Learning</h3>
                        <p>When you start learning to cook, you begin with simple recipes, like frying an egg or cooking rice. Each time you cook, you learn something new - how high to turn the heat, how long to cook the eggs, how much water you should put in your rice. This is like how traditional machine learning works.</p>
                        <p>But what if you want to learn to cook a complex dish, like fried chicken? There are so many variables to consider - how you bread the chicken, what temperature you fry it at, and what sort of oil you use. This is where deep learning comes in, handling multiple variables and their interactions.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>Deep learning, like frying chicken, involves a lot of trial and error. The neural network makes an assumption (or a guess), checks how close it was to the right answer, and then adjusts its parameters for the next guess. This process is repeated over and over again, each time getting closer to the correct answer.</p>
                    
                    <p>Just like having more recipes can enhance your cooking skills, the more data the computer has to train on, the better it will be at making accurate predictions.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"applications\">
                    <h2>Real-World Applications of Deep Learning</h2>
                    <p>And as a child learns to recognize images from animal cards, a computer can learn to generate human language. Another branch of AI is natural language processing, or NLP, which uses similar principles as deep learning but focuses on language.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Laptop with Learning -->
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"100\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#333\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"105\" y=\"105\" width=\"70\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"160\" width=\"80\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Child Learning -->
                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"120\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"55\" y=\"135\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"65\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"75\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"65\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Animal Image on Screen -->
                            <rect x=\"115\" y=\"115\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"122\" cy=\"122\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <!-- Eye -->
                            <circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"122\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <!-- Eye -->
                            <path d=\"M127 127 L127 132\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Beak -->
                            <path d=\"M117 117 L137 117\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path> <!-- Wings -->
                            
                            <!-- Child\'s Recognition -->
                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">\"That\'s a bird!\"</text>
                            <path d=\"M60 105 L60 115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Computer\'s Processing -->
                            <text x=\"145\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Bird: 98%</text>
                            <text x=\"145\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Cat: 1%</text>
                            <text x=\"145\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Dog: 1%</text>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Section -->
                            <rect x=\"220\" y=\"80\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"235\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Natural Language Processing</text>
                            
                            <!-- Words on Monitor -->
                            <rect x=\"230\" y=\"110\" width=\"130\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">The quick brown fox jumps</text>
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">over the lazy dog.</text>
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">El zorro marrón rápido salta</text>
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">sobre el perro perezoso.</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection Between Image and Text -->
                            <path d=\"M175 120 C200 100, 210 80, 220 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M175 140 C200 160, 210 180, 220 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Data Flow -->
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"70\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"126\" y=\"74\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">DATA</text>
                            <path d=\"M140 90 C140 100, 140 110, 140 105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"140,105 137,100 143,100\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"50\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"266\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">DATA</text>
                            <path d=\"M280 70 C280 80, 280 90, 280 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"280,80 277,75 283,75\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Deep learning powers image recognition and natural language processing, enabling computers to understand and generate human-like content.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>The more textual data a computer learns from, the more proficient it becomes at producing human-like language. This is the foundation for many of the AI tools we use today, from virtual assistants to language translation services.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>Beyond Text and Images</h3>
                        <p>Deep learning has applications across numerous fields:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Healthcare:</strong> Analyzing medical images for early disease detection</li>
                            <li><strong>Autonomous Vehicles:</strong> Processing sensor data to navigate safely</li>
                            <li><strong>Finance:</strong> Detecting fraudulent transactions in real-time</li>
                            <li><strong>Entertainment:</strong> Recommending content based on your preferences</li>
                            <li><strong>Science:</strong> Accelerating drug discovery and understanding protein folding</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>As deep learning continues to evolve, it will play an increasingly important role in solving complex problems and enhancing our daily lives. The key is providing these systems with high-quality data and ensuring they\'re designed to learn effectively from their experiences.</p>
                </section>
            </div>', '107', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('9', '1', 'Chapter 1.08: Natural Language Processing (NLP)', 'Exploring how AI understands, interprets, and generates human language', 'chapter9', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
                    <h2>Understanding Natural Language Processing</h2>
                    <p>Did you know that every time you ask your phone about the weather or when autocorrect saves you from sending a text full of typos, you are interacting with a branch of AI called natural language processing, or NLP?</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Text Message Correction -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"70\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"65\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Wat are yuo doinh</text>
                            <text x=\"65\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">on satundai nay?</text>
                            
                            <path d=\"M180 105 L210 105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"210,105 205,102 205,108\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <rect x=\"220\" y=\"70\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"230\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"235\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">What are you doing</text>
                            <text x=\"235\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">on Saturday night?</text>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Elements -->
                            <ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"40\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></ellipse>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"45\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">NLP</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connected Elements -->
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"132\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Txt</text>
                            <line x1=\"155\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"183\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Spk</text>
                            <line x1=\"205\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"233\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Snt</text>
                            <line x1=\"255\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"283\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Lrn</text>
                            
                            <!-- Caption Elements -->
                            <text x=\"135\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Text</text>
                            <text x=\"175\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Speech</text>
                            <text x=\"230\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Sentiment</text>
                            <text x=\"280\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Learning</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection to NLP -->
                            <path d=\"M140 135 C150 100, 180 70, 190 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M190 135 C195 110, 195 70, 195 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M240 135 C235 110, 210 70, 205 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M290 135 C280 100, 220 70, 210 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Natural Language Processing (NLP) enables machines to understand, interpret, and generate human language in a meaningful way.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>What is Natural Language Processing?</h3>
                        <p>NLP can read, decipher, understand and make sense of human language. It does this through various methods such as text analysis, translation, sentiment analysis, and speech recognition.</p>
                        <p>NLP is the technology that powers many of the AI systems we interact with daily, from virtual assistants to search engines and translation services.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"nlp-basics\">
                    <h2>How NLP Works</h2>
                    <p>NLP acts like a translator between us and our devices. It helps our devices understand not just the words we say, but also what we mean.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"250\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 250\">
                            <!-- Laptop Screen Text Analysis -->
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"70\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"110\" y=\"80\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">the brown fox jumps far</text>
                            
                            <!-- Text Analysis Highlight -->
                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"97\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"153\" y=\"97\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"177\" y=\"97\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Computer Analysis -->
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Noun: fox</text>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Adjective: brown</text>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Verb: jumps</text>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Adverb: far</text>
                            
                            <!-- Woman with Headscarf -->
                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"120\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"45\" y=\"140\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            <path d=\"M30 120 C40 100, 60 100, 70 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M30 120 L30 140 L70 140 L70 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Speech Bubble -->
                            <path d=\"M75 110 Q90 100, 110 110 L110 130 Q110 140, 100 140 L85 140 Q75 140, 75 130 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <text x=\"85\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Hello!</text>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Analysis Tools -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"200\" width=\"300\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"210\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.5\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"65\" y=\"224\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Text Analysis</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"130\" y=\"210\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"135\" y=\"224\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Translation</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"210\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"205\" y=\"224\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Sentiment Analysis</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"210\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"285\" y=\"224\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Speech Recog</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection Lines -->
                            <path d=\"M90 200 L130 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M160 200 L160 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M235 200 L190 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M310 200 L310 140 L80 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">NLP systems analyze text to identify parts of speech, relationships between words, and meaning, enabling computers to understand language.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>For example, think about the last time you used a search engine like Bing to find the lyrics of your favorite song. You typed in the song name and lyrics, and just like that, Bing showed you exactly what you were looking for. But how did it know you wanted the lyrics and not the music video or information about the singer?</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>Components of NLP</h3>
                        <p>NLP systems typically involve several components:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Tokenization:</strong> Breaking text into words, phrases, symbols, or other meaningful elements</li>
                            <li><strong>Part-of-speech tagging:</strong> Identifying whether words are nouns, verbs, adjectives, etc.</li>
                            <li><strong>Syntactic analysis:</strong> Analyzing the grammatical structure of sentences</li>
                            <li><strong>Semantic analysis:</strong> Understanding the meaning of text based on context</li>
                            <li><strong>Pragmatic analysis:</strong> Interpreting text based on the situation or real-world knowledge</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"text-correction\">
                    <h2>Text Autocorrection and Prediction</h2>
                    <p>One of the most common NLP applications we interact with daily is text autocorrection. When you\'re typing on your phone and it suggests the next word or corrects a misspelling, that\'s NLP at work.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Search Bar -->
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"70\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">twinkle, twinkle, little star</text>
                            
                            <!-- Search Suggestions -->
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"100\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            
                            <rect x=\"105\" y=\"105\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Twinkle, twinkle, little star</text>
                            
                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Twinkle, twinkle, little star song</text>
                            
                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Twinkle, twinkle, little star English</text>
                            
                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"180\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Twinkle, twinkle, little star chords</text>
                            
                            <!-- Lyrics Result -->
                            <rect x=\"320\" y=\"70\" width=\"60\" height=\"130\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Twinkle, twinkle,</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">little star,</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">How I wonder</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">what you are.</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Up above the</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">world so high,</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Like a diamond</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">in the sky.</text>
                            <text x=\"330\" y=\"180\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">Jane Taylor, 1806</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection Arrow -->
                            <path d=\"M300 85 L320 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"320,85 315,82 315,88\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Processing Illustration -->
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"210\" width=\"100\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"215\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"215\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"215\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"215\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">NLP algorithms power search engines to understand your queries and find exactly what you\'re looking for, like song lyrics.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>So, whether you are searching for song lyrics, asking your phone about the weather, or translating a sentence into a different language, NLP is there, making it feel like you are chatting with a person.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"translation\">
                    <h2>Language Translation</h2>
                    <p>One of the most impressive applications of NLP is language translation. Modern translation systems can quickly convert text from one language to another while preserving much of the original meaning and context.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- English Text Box -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">the quick brown fox</text>
                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">jumps over the</text>
                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">lazy dog</text>
                            
                            <!-- Arrow -->
                            <path d=\"M170 110 L230 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"230,110 225,107 225,113\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Processing Box -->
                            <rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"185\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">NLP</text>
                            <path d=\"M185 105 L215 105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></path>
                            <text x=\"190\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Translation</text>
                            <text x=\"195\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Engine</text>
                            
                            <!-- Chinese Text Box -->
                            <rect x=\"230\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <!-- Chinese characters representation -->
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">快速的棕色狐狸</text>
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">跳過了懶惰的狗</text>
                            
                            <!-- Woman Looking at Phone -->
                            <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"180\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"105\" y=\"195\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"105\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"215\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"115\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"215\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"165\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#666\" rx=\"2\"></rect> <!-- Hair -->
                            
                            <!-- Phone -->
                            <rect x=\"130\" y=\"185\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"132\" y=\"188\" width=\"11\" height=\"19\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Thought Bubble -->
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"170\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"165\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M150 155 Q160 145, 170 155 L170 165 Q170 170, 165 170 L155 170 Q150 170, 150 165 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <text x=\"155\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">¡Hola!</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">NLP-powered translation services can convert text between languages, breaking down communication barriers worldwide.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Machine Translation</h3>
                        <p>Modern machine translation uses sophisticated neural networks to understand the context and meaning of sentences, not just word-by-word translations. This results in more natural and accurate translations between languages.</p>
                        <p>These systems improve over time as they\'re exposed to more examples of translations, learning the nuances and idioms that make language translation challenging.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"applications\">
                    <h2>Real-World Applications of NLP</h2>
                    <p>When we talk about different branches of AI like NLP, we can sort them based on the kind of problems they solve. Some AI algorithms are great at recognizing images, some are experts at understanding language, and others are pros at predicting trends.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Application Categories -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Virtual Assistant -->
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"85\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Virtual</text>
                            <text x=\"75\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Assistants</text>
                            
                            <!-- Sentiment Analysis -->
                            <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"85\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Sentiment</text>
                            <text x=\"155\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Analysis</text>
                            
                            <!-- Text Summarization -->
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"85\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"230\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Text</text>
                            <text x=\"215\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Summarization</text>
                            
                            <!-- Chatbots -->
                            <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"85\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Chatbots</text>
                            
                            <!-- Translation Services -->
                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"145\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Translation</text>
                            <text x=\"85\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Services</text>
                            
                            <!-- Content Generation -->
                            <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"145\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"155\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Content</text>
                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Generation</text>
                            
                            <!-- Search Optimization -->
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"145\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"225\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Search</text>
                            <text x=\"215\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Optimization</text>
                            
                            <!-- Grammar Checking -->
                            <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"145\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"295\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Grammar</text>
                            <text x=\"295\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Checking</text>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Central Hub -->
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"115\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"192\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFF\">NLP</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection Lines -->
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">NLP powers a wide range of applications from virtual assistants and chatbots to content generation and grammar checking tools.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>NLP in Everyday Life</h3>
                        <p>Natural Language Processing has become an integral part of our daily digital experiences:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Virtual Assistants:</strong> Siri, Alexa, and Google Assistant understand your voice commands</li>
                            <li><strong>Email Filters:</strong> Automatically categorize your emails and detect spam</li>
                            <li><strong>Predictive Text:</strong> Suggests what you might type next on your phone</li>
                            <li><strong>Social Media Analysis:</strong> Monitors brand sentiment and customer feedback</li>
                            <li><strong>Healthcare Documentation:</strong> Assists in converting spoken notes to medical records</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>So next time you use your phone or computer, remember AI is working behind the scenes making you more connected than ever before. Natural Language Processing is a powerful technology that continues to evolve, breaking down language barriers and making human-computer interaction more natural and intuitive.</p>
                </section>
            </div>', '108', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('10', '1', 'Chapter 1.09: AI Algorithms', 'Understanding the step-by-step instructions that power AI systems', 'chapter10', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
                    <h2>How AI Algorithms Work</h2>
                    <p>Ever wondered how your email knows what is junk mail and what is not? Or how does your music app always hit the right note with its recommendations? That happens thanks to something called AI algorithms.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Laptop with Algorithm Concept -->
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"80\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"155\" y=\"85\" width=\"90\" height=\"55\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"150\" width=\"100\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- AI Text on Screen -->
                            <text x=\"190\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">AI</text>
                            
                            <!-- Email Filtering Concept -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"90\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <path d=\"M50 100 L80 115 L110 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"110\" width=\"40\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Waste Basket -->
                            <path d=\"M80 140 L70 160 L90 160 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M75 140 L75 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M80 140 L80 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M85 140 L85 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Arrow Email to Trash -->
                            <path d=\"M80 130 L80 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"80,140 77,135 83,135\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- Music Recommendation Concept -->
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"90\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"110\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"295\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\">♪</text>
                            
                            <!-- Recipe Concept for Algorithm -->
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"285\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Butter</text>
                            <text x=\"285\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Flour</text>
                            <text x=\"285\" y=\"185\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Eggs</text>
                            
                            <!-- Recipe Card -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"180\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"55\" y=\"195\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Apricot Cake Recipe</text>
                            <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Connection Lines -->
                            <path d=\"M80 110 L150 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M280 110 L250 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M210 170 L280 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M150 170 L80 170 L80 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">AI algorithms are like recipes that guide computers to solve problems, from filtering emails to recommending music.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>What Are AI Algorithms?</h3>
                        <p>AI algorithms are step-by-step instructions given to a computer to solve specific problems or perform tasks. Imagine these algorithms as a set of instructions that guide a computer to solve a problem, much like a recipe guiding you to bake a cake.</p>
                        <p>These algorithms form the backbone of AI systems, enabling them to process data, learn patterns, and make decisions or predictions.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>Machine learning, a subset of AI, encompasses deep learning as one of its own subsets. These subsets represent different methodologies through which a computer system can learn from data to solve problems. Within these, there are different learning methods like supervised learning, unsupervised learning and reinforcement learning, and each one of these methods uses a specific set of instructions, or algorithms, which guides the computer on how to solve a problem. And depending on the problem, the algorithm might be quite different.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"classification\">
                    <h2>Classification Algorithms: Sorting and Categorizing</h2>
                    <p>Imagine you are sifting through your emails. Some are important, others... not so much. How does your email service know which ones to put in your inbox and which ones to label as spam?</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Email Classification Visualization -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"70\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Inbox Emails -->
