                            <path d=\"M140 107 L137 110 L140 113\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <text x=\"145\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">$$$</text>
                            
                            <!-- Crystal Ball Prediction -->
                            <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"130\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"130\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FFF\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"270\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\">$</text>
                            
                            <!-- Hands Around Crystal Ball -->
                            <path d=\"M255 130 C245 140, 245 160, 255 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M305 130 C315 140, 315 160, 305 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Regression Engine -->
                            <rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"185\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Regression</text>
                            <text x=\"190\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Algorithm</text>
                            
                            <!-- House Features Input -->
                            <path d=\"M130 130 L180 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"180,130 175,127 175,133\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- Prediction Output -->
                            <path d=\"M240 130 L255 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"255,130 250,127 250,133\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- Feature List -->
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"150\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"160\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">• Square Footage: 1,800</text>
                            <text x=\"160\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">• Bedrooms: 3</text>
                            <text x=\"160\" y=\"185\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">• Bathrooms: 2</text>
                            <text x=\"160\" y=\"195\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">• Location: Downtown</text>
                            <text x=\"160\" y=\"205\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">• Year Built: 2010</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Regression algorithms predict continuous values, like house prices, based on multiple factors such as size, location, and features.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>They use a type of algorithm called regression. It is like a fortune teller, predicting the future based on information like size, location, and other factors.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Predictive Power</h3>
                        <p>Regression algorithms analyze the relationship between variables to predict a numerical outcome. Unlike classification (which assigns categories), regression predicts a continuous value.</p>
                        <p>These algorithms are essential for applications like:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Price prediction for houses, stocks, or products</li>
                            <li>Weather forecasting (temperature, rainfall)</li>
                            <li>Estimating sales or revenue</li>
                            <li>Predicting resource consumption (energy, bandwidth)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"clustering\">
                    <h2>Clustering Algorithms: Finding Patterns</h2>
                    <p>Ever noticed how your favorite music app always knows just the right song to recommend?</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
