                            <rect x=\"70\" y=\"95\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#333\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"95\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#333\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"75\" y=\"130\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"140\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"110\" y=\"140\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Smartwatch Illustration -->
                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"100\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"205\" y=\"105\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                            <path d=\"M195 120 L200 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M230 120 L235 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <text x=\"210\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">AI</text>
                            
                            <!-- Car Illustration -->
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"130\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"290\" y=\"110\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"295\" cy=\"160\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"295\" cy=\"160\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"335\" cy=\"160\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"335\" cy=\"160\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></circle>
                            
                            <!-- Central AI Hub -->
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"50\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"190\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">AI</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connections -->
                            <path d=\"M200 70 L100 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M200 70 L215 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M200 70 L315 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Data Flow Arrows -->
                            <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"75\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <polygon points=\"150,75 145,70 155,70\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></polygon>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"207\" cy=\"85\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <polygon points=\"207,85 202,80 212,80\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></polygon>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <polygon points=\"260,90 255,85 265,85\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></polygon>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">AI systems like robots, smartwatches, and autonomous vehicles use interconnected AI technologies to function.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Integrated AI Systems</h3>
                        <p>In real-world applications, multiple AI components often work together to create sophisticated systems. These integrated systems combine various AI technologies:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Machine Learning Models:</strong> For pattern recognition and prediction</li>
                            <li><strong>Computer Vision:</strong> To interpret visual information</li>
                            <li><strong>Natural Language Processing:</strong> To understand and generate human language</li>
                            <li><strong>Sensors and IoT Devices:</strong> To collect real-world data</li>
                            <li><strong>Decision-Making Algorithms:</strong> To determine appropriate actions</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>You have probably heard of robots and self-driving cars, but what about the Internet of Things? Simply put, the IoT is a vast network of interconnected physical devices, ranging from everyday household items like smart door locks and smart thermostats to wearable devices such as smart watches.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"internet-of-things\">
                    <h2>The Internet of Things (IoT)</h2>
                    <p>These devices are connected to the internet, collecting, and sharing data. This connectivity allows these devices to communicate with each other and us, streamlining our lives in the process.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- House with IoT Devices -->
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"100\" width=\"100\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <polygon points=\"150,100 200,50 250,100\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\"></polygon>
