                            <!-- Smart Laptop -->
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"150\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"145\" width=\"40\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"285\" y=\"155\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">IoT</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection Signal from House -->
                            <path d=\"M200 80 C190 70, 180 65, 165 65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M200 80 C210 70, 220 65, 235 65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M200 80 C200 70, 200 60, 200 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- IoT Devices -->
                            <circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"65\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"161\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#FFF\">C</text>
                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Camera</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"65\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"231\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#FFF\">L</text>
                            <text x=\"225\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Lights</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"196\" y=\"53\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#FFF\">T</text>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Thermostat</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection to External Devices -->
                            <path d=\"M165 80 L100 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M235 80 L300 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Fridge with Notification -->
                            <rect x=\"270\" y=\"90\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"270\" y=\"90\" width=\"30\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"275\" y=\"105\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"260\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Low on milk</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"310\" y=\"110\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"312\" y=\"123\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Milk</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">The Internet of Things (IoT) connects smart devices in homes and wearables, allowing them to communicate and share data.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>The internet is not just about your smartphone or laptop. It is much more expansive. The internet has woven itself into our everyday lives. From connected homes to smart appliances, the internet is everywhere.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>Smart Appliances</h3>
                        <p>Imagine a refrigerator equipped with technology that knows exactly when you are running low on milk and sends you a reminder to pick some up on your way home. That is the power of IoT.</p>
                        <p>These smart devices collect vast amounts of data about their surroundings and usage patterns. AI algorithms then process this data to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Predict when maintenance might be needed</li>
                            <li>Optimize energy consumption</li>
                            <li>Automate routine tasks</li>
                            <li>Provide personalized recommendations</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"robots\">
                    <h2>Robotics and AI</h2>
                    <p>Robots are often seen performing repetitive tasks and interacting with humans. But they are also a goldmine of data! Every movement, interaction and task a robot performs can be translated into valuable data.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"240\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 240\">
