                        <p class=\"caption\">Smart homes connect multiple IoT devices through a central hub, allowing them to work together and respond to user preferences.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>This data not only enriches our AI models but also empowers us to drive innovation and efficiency. So, the next time you think about the physical world connecting with the virtual world, remember, it is not just about convenience. It is about harnessing the power of data to make our AI models smarter and our lives better.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>The Connected Home Ecosystem</h3>
                        <p>Modern smart homes demonstrate how different AI technologies work together as an integrated system:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Voice Recognition:</strong> Smart speakers use NLP to understand commands</li>
                            <li><strong>Learning Algorithms:</strong> Thermostats learn your schedule and preferences</li>
                            <li><strong>Computer Vision:</strong> Security cameras identify people and unusual activities</li>
                            <li><strong>Predictive Analytics:</strong> Systems anticipate your needs based on patterns</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>These systems constantly collect and analyze data, becoming more personalized and helpful over time.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"self-driving\">
                    <h2>Autonomous Vehicles</h2>
                    <p>Consider self-driving cars. These vehicles collect vast amounts of data about their surroundings and use this information to navigate the roads safely and efficiently.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"240\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 240\">
                            <!-- Road Background -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"130\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"159\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"159\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"140\" y=\"159\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"180\" y=\"159\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"220\" y=\"159\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"260\" y=\"159\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"159\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Self-driving Car -->
                            <rect x=\"130\" y=\"140\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"140\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"160\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"160\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"160\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"160\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></circle>
                            
                            <!-- Other Cars -->
                            <rect x=\"220\" y=\"145\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"225\" cy=\"160\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"160\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"145\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"160\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"160\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            
                            <!-- Trees -->
                            <rect x=\"70\" y=\"100\" width=\"5\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#8B4513\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            
                            <rect x=\"270\" y=\"100\" width=\"5\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#8B4513\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"272\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            
                            <!-- Pedestrian -->
                            <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"110\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"228\" y=\"115\" width=\"5\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"228\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"223\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"233\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Sensor Detection -->
                            <path d=\"M160 140 L230 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M160 140 L220 145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M160 140 L80 145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M160 140 L70 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M160 140 L270 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Detection Boxes -->
                            <rect x=\"225\" y=\"105\" width=\"10\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"220\" y=\"145\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"145\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"67\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4BFB9D\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"267\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4BFB9D\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- AI Processing -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">AI System: Object Detection | Path Planning | Decision Making</text>
                            
                            <!-- Decision Output -->
                            <path d=\"M160 130 L160 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"160,80 157,85 163,85\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- Scenario Info -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"200\" width=\"300\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FFF\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"215\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Detected: 2 vehicles, 1 pedestrian, 2 trees</text>
                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"225\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Decision: Maintain speed, monitor pedestrian</text>
                            <text x=\"220\" y=\"215\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Path: Clear ahead</text>
                            <text x=\"220\" y=\"225\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Safety Rating: 98%</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Self-driving cars use sensors and AI to detect objects, plan routes, and make driving decisions in real-time.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>This data not only enriches our AI models but also empowers us to drive innovation and efficiency. As we continue to explore and innovate, AI technology is playing an increasingly important role in solving complex problems and enhancing our daily lives.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>AI System Integration in Autonomous Vehicles</h3>
                        <p>Self-driving cars represent one of the most sophisticated applications of AI, combining multiple systems:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Perception:</strong> Using cameras, radar, and lidar to understand the environment</li>
                            <li><strong>Localization:</strong> Determining precise position using GPS and map data</li>
                            <li><strong>Prediction:</strong> Anticipating how other road users will behave</li>
                            <li><strong>Planning:</strong> Determining the safest and most efficient route</li>
                            <li><strong>Control:</strong> Converting decisions into steering, acceleration, and braking</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>These systems must work together seamlessly and make split-second decisions that ensure safety while navigating complex environments.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>The integration of AI into everyday objects and systems is transforming how we interact with technology. From smart homes to self-driving cars, AI is becoming an invisible but powerful force that enhances our capabilities and makes our lives more efficient.</p>
                </section>
            </div>', '110', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('12', '2', 'Chapter 2.11: What is Generative AI?', 'Understanding the capabilities and applications of generative artificial intelligence', 'chapter1_11', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
                    <h2>Introduction to Generative AI</h2>
                    <p>Imagine you are trying to write a heartfelt birthday card, but the right words escape you. Then, an AI companion offers creative suggestions, and suddenly, the perfect message flows onto the card. This is the power of generative AI, transforming our approach to creativity and productivity.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Birthday Card Illustration -->
                            <rect x=\"130\" y=\"60\" width=\"140\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"130\" y=\"60\" width=\"70\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.4\" rx=\"5 0 0 5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"140\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Happy</text>
                            <text x=\"140\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Birthday!</text>
                            
                            <!-- Cake Illustration -->
                            <rect x=\"210\" y=\"80\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.6\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"205\" y=\"75\" width=\"50\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"215\" y=\"65\" width=\"30\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.6\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"58\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"58\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"58\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            
                            <!-- Person thinking -->
                            <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"85\" y=\"105\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"85\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"75\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"75\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"107\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">?</text>
                            
                            <!-- AI Suggestion -->
                            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"90\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">AI</text>
                            
                            <!-- Lightbulb -->
                            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"297\" y=\"60\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Connections -->
                            <path d=\"M300 70 L270 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M270 120 L230 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M105 90 L130 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Pen -->
                            <rect x=\"180\" y=\"130\" width=\"2\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <polygon points=\"180,130 182,130 183,125 179,125\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Generative AI can assist with creative tasks like writing a personalized birthday message.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>What is Generative AI?</h3>
                        <p>Generative AI refers to a category of artificial intelligence algorithms that generate new outputs based on the data they have been trained on. By identifying patterns found in data, generative AI can produce entirely new and original creations, mirroring the intricate complexity of human imagination.</p>
                        <p>Unlike traditional AI systems that are designed to analyze or classify existing data, generative AI can create:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Original text and written content</li>
                            <li>Visual artwork and images</li>
                            <li>Music and audio compositions</li>
                            <li>Video content</li>
                            <li>Programming code</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>This technology allows us to focus on what we do best: envisioning, innovating, setting goals, and pursuing our dreams, while AI handles many of the technical execution details. Generative AI represents a significant shift in our relationship with technology, becoming a creative partner rather than just a tool.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"history\">
                    <h2>History and Evolution</h2>
                    <p>Generative AI has its roots in early AI research and mathematical explorations, including the creation of chatbots in the 1960s. The technology has evolved dramatically over decades, with several key developments marking its progress.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                            <!-- Timeline -->
                            <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Timeline Points -->
                            <!-- 1960s -->
                            <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"100\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"70\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1960s</text>
                            <text x=\"70\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Early Chatbots</text>
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"140\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"70\" y=\"153\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ELIZA</text>
                            
                            <!-- 1990s -->
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"100\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"140\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1990s</text>
                            <text x=\"140\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Neural Networks</text>
                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"140\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"140\" y=\"153\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Early NNs</text>
                            
                            <!-- 2010s -->
                            <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"100\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"210\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2010s</text>
                            <text x=\"210\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GANs Introduced</text>
                            <rect x=\"190\" y=\"140\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"210\" y=\"153\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GAN</text>
                            
                            <!-- 2018-2020 -->
                            <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"100\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"280\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2018-2020</text>
                            <text x=\"280\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GPT, DALL·E</text>
                            <rect x=\"260\" y=\"140\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"280\" y=\"153\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Transformers</text>
                            
                            <!-- 2021+ -->
                            <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"100\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"350\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2021+</text>
                            <text x=\"350\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mainstream</text>
                            <rect x=\"330\" y=\"140\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"350\" y=\"153\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Public Access</text>
                            
                            <!-- Arrow -->
                            <polygon points=\"350,100 345,95 345,105\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- Timeline Header -->
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evolution of Generative AI</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">The evolution of generative AI from early chatbots to modern systems.</p>
                    </div>

                    <p>A significant advancement came with the introduction of Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs) in the 2010s. These systems consist of two neural networks—a generator and a discriminator—that work together to produce increasingly realistic outputs.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>Key Milestones in Generative AI</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>1960s:</strong> Creation of early chatbots like ELIZA</li>
                            <li><strong>1990s-2000s:</strong> Development of early neural network approaches</li>
                            <li><strong>2014:</strong> Introduction of Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs)</li>
                            <li><strong>2017-2019:</strong> Development of transformer-based architectures</li>
                            <li><strong>2020:</strong> Release of GPT-3, DALL·E, and other breakthrough models</li>
                            <li><strong>2021+:</strong> Generative AI becomes mainstream with public-facing applications</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>Fast forward to recent developments, Generative Pre-trained Transformers (GPTs) have significantly advanced natural language processing and generation capabilities. These networks have transformed the field, enabling the creation of sophisticated text, images, videos, and audio with remarkable human-like qualities.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"capabilities\">
                    <h2>Capabilities of Generative AI</h2>
                    <p>Modern generative AI systems are capable of creating content that can be virtually indistinguishable from human-created work. These systems learn from patterns in their training data and can produce new outputs that follow similar patterns while being unique and original.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Brain and AI Processing Illustration -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"70\" width=\"100\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"75\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Training Data</text>
                            
                            <!-- Neural Network -->
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"60\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"120\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"75\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"105\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"135\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"120\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"105\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                            
                            <!-- Network Connections -->
                            <!-- Layer 1 to 2 -->
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Layer 2 to 3 -->
                            <line x1=\"248\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"248\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <line x1=\"248\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"248\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <line x1=\"248\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"248\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Layer 3 to 4 -->
                            <line x1=\"288\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"288\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Data Flow -->
                            <path d=\"M150 110 L192 105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"192,105 187,102 187,108\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- Output -->
                            <rect x=\"340\" y=\"85\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"328\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                            <polygon points=\"340,105 335,102 335,108\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                            <text x=\"360\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">New</text>
                            <text x=\"360\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Content</text>
                            
                            <!-- Output Types -->
                            <rect x=\"340\" y=\"40\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"350\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T</text>
                            <text x=\"360\" y=\"30\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\">Text</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <line x1=\"346\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"354\" y2=\"154\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"346\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"354\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <text x=\"350\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Images</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"40\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"47\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"47\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M302 52 L318 52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <text x=\"310\" y=\"30\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Audio</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"150\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"310\" y=\"162\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">▶</text>
                            <text x=\"310\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Video</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Generative AI systems process training data through neural networks to create new content across multiple modalities.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Core Capabilities of Generative AI</h3>
                        <p>Generative AI demonstrates several remarkable capabilities:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Pattern Recognition:</strong> Identifying complex patterns in large datasets</li>
                            <li><strong>Content Generation:</strong> Creating original content based on learned patterns</li>
                            <li><strong>Style Transfer:</strong> Applying the stylistic elements of one creation to another</li>
                            <li><strong>Multimodal Creation:</strong> Working across different types of data (text, image, etc.)</li>
                            <li><strong>Contextual Understanding:</strong> Generating content appropriate to specific contexts</li>
                            <li><strong>Iterative Improvement:</strong> Refining outputs based on feedback</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>This is achieved through machine learning models that have been trained on extensive amounts of data. These models can understand complex patterns within the data. Once trained, they can generate new content that mirrors the structure and style of the training data yet is entirely original.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"applications\">
                    <h2>Applications and Use Cases</h2>
                    <p>The applications of generative AI span across industries and creative domains, transforming how we approach content creation, problem-solving, and innovation.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Central AI Hub -->
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
