                        <p class=\"caption\">Generative AI spans multiple creative and practical domains, transforming industries and workflows.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Major Application Areas</h3>
                        <p>Generative AI is being used across numerous industries and domains:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Creative Content:</strong> Writing, art creation, music composition, video generation</li>
                            <li><strong>Software Development:</strong> Code generation, debugging, documentation</li>
                            <li><strong>Design:</strong> UI/UX prototyping, graphic design, product visualization</li>
                            <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> Content creation, personalized campaigns, social media</li>
                            <li><strong>Education:</strong> Personalized learning materials, interactive exercises</li>
                            <li><strong>Healthcare:</strong> Medical research assistance, patient education materials</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>These applications demonstrate how generative AI is not just a technological innovation but a transformative force across industries. By automating creative and technical processes, it allows professionals to focus on higher-level strategy and the human elements of their work.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"future\">
                    <h2>Future Potential and Implications</h2>
                    <p>As generative AI continues to evolve, its potential impact on society, work, and creativity expands. The technology is poised to reshape numerous aspects of how we live and work.</p>
                    
