                        <p class=\"caption\">A future where generative AI works alongside humans, enhancing creativity and productivity.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Emerging Frontiers for Generative AI</h3>
                        <p>As generative AI technology continues to advance, several key areas show particular promise:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Personalized Education:</strong> Creating customized learning materials and experiences</li>
                            <li><strong>Scientific Discovery:</strong> Suggesting new experimental approaches and hypotheses</li>
                            <li><strong>Creative Collaboration:</strong> AI as a creative partner rather than just a tool</li>
                            <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Making content creation possible for people of all abilities</li>
                            <li><strong>Virtual Experiences:</strong> Generating immersive environments and interactions</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>The most exciting potential of generative AI may lie not in replacing human creativity, but in enhancing it. By handling routine aspects of creative work and offering new possibilities, AI allows us to focus on the uniquely human elements of imagination, emotional connection, and purpose.</p>
                </section>
            </div>', '211', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('13', '2', 'Chapter 2.12: What is a Generative AI Model?', 'Understanding the structure, types, and applications of AI models that generate content', 'chapter2_12', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
                    <h2>Understanding AI Models</h2>
                    <p>Artificial intelligence can be designed to perform specific tasks. This includes everything from self-driving cars and weather forecasting to virtual assistants. AI models are like the brains of these AI systems.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
