                            <!-- Different AI Applications -->
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"85\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"88\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">🚗</text>
                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Self-driving</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"150\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <path d=\"M70 165 L90 165\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M70 170 L85 170\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"190\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Weather</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"85\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"320\" y=\"88\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Siri</text>
                            <text x=\"320\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Virtual Assistant</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"150\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"165\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <circle cx=\"325\" cy=\"165\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M315 172 L325 172\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <text x=\"320\" y=\"190\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Chat</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connections to Brain -->
                            <path d=\"M100 85 C120 85, 130 85, 140 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M100 165 C120 140, 130 140, 140 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M300 85 C280 85, 270 85, 260 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M300 165 C280 140, 270 140, 260 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI Models</text>
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The \"brains\" powering AI systems</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">AI models serve as the brains of AI systems, enabling a wide range of applications from self-driving cars to virtual assistants.</p>
                    </div>

                    <p>These models are mathematical structures that learn patterns from data using algorithms. Interestingly, there are different types of AI models, and their capabilities vary significantly based on their design and training.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>What Makes a Model \"Generative\"?</h3>
                        <p>AI models can be broadly classified into two main categories:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Discriminative Models:</strong> These models identify or classify existing information. They answer questions like \"Which category does this data belong to?\" or \"Is this email spam or not?\"</li>
                            <li><strong>Generative Models:</strong> These models create new content based on patterns they\'ve learned. They can generate text, images, music, code, and more that hasn\'t existed before.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Generative AI models have the unique ability to create novel outputs that follow the patterns of their training data without directly copying it. This ability to \"generate\" new content is what sets them apart.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>For example, when you interact with Siri on your mobile phone, it is not exhibiting intelligence in the same way a human would. Rather, humans have programmed it to respond to certain prompts and execute functions, such as providing the latest weather update in your area or letting you know your local news.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"model-types\">
                    <h2>Types of Generative AI Models</h2>
                    <p>There are several important types of generative AI models, each with different approaches to content generation and specific strengths and applications.</p>
                    
