                            <path d=\"M70 150 L77 155 L85 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Report icon -->
                            <rect x=\"95\" y=\"150\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"98\" y1=\"153\" x2=\"107\" y2=\"153\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"98\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"107\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Chart icon -->
                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"150\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <path d=\"M123 156 L125 152 L127 154 L130 148\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- Development Applications - Bottom Right -->
                            <rect x=\"260\" y=\"170\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"185\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Development</text>
                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"200\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Applications</text>
                            <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Code icon -->
                            <rect x=\"270\" y=\"150\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"277\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{}</text>
                            
                            <!-- Debug icon -->
                            <rect x=\"295\" y=\"150\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"303\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">!</text>
                            
                            <!-- Document icon -->
                            <rect x=\"320\" y=\"150\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <line x1=\"323\" y1=\"153\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"153\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"323\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                            
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"25\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Practical Applications of Generative AI</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Generative AI models have applications across creative, educational, business, and development domains.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Major Application Areas</h3>
                        <p>Generative AI models are transforming work and creation across multiple domains:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Creative Content:</strong> Generating art, writing, music, and design concepts</li>
                            <li><strong>Education:</strong> Creating personalized learning materials, explanations, and practice problems</li>
                            <li><strong>Business:</strong> Drafting emails, reports, marketing copy, and data analysis</li>
                            <li><strong>Software Development:</strong> Writing code, debugging existing programs, and generating documentation</li>
                            <li><strong>Science and Research:</strong> Suggesting hypotheses, analyzing data patterns, and generating research summaries</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>The Microsoft Copilot Copyright Commitment is an example of an initiative created to address potential intellectual property concerns around AI-generated content. This commitment extends existing IP security support to commercial Copilot services, addressing potential infringement liability that could arise from the use of the output of Microsoft\'s Copilots and Azure OpenAI Service.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>Example: Microsoft Copilot</h3>
                        <p>Microsoft Copilot is an AI-powered productivity tool designed to enhance daily life by leveraging the power of generative AI models. It can:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Boost productivity through automated task handling</li>
                            <li>Unlock creativity by suggesting ideas and generating content</li>
                            <li>Enhance understanding through summaries and explanations</li>
                            <li>Create images based on text prompts using DALL·E</li>
                            <li>Assist software developers with code generation and analysis</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Copilot integrates with various Microsoft products and services, making AI assistance available across work and personal contexts.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>As generative AI models continue to evolve, their applications will likely expand into new domains and become more sophisticated. The most effective use of these models often involves human-AI collaboration, where the AI generates content that humans then refine and enhance with their unique perspectives and expertise.</p>
                </section>
            </div>', '212', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('14', '2', 'Chapter 2.13: AI Linguistics', 'Understanding how AI systems process, comprehend, and generate human language', 'chapter3_13', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
                    <h2>Introduction to AI Linguistics</h2>
                    <p>Have you ever wondered how your mobile phone understands what you are saying? Or how it can suggest words while you are typing a message? That is all thanks to some clever technology behind some interesting acronyms.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                            <!-- Mobile phone with speech bubbles -->
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"40\" width=\"70\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"155\" y=\"50\" width=\"60\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#FFF\"></rect>
                            <circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"150\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FFF\"></circle>
                            
                            <!-- Speech bubbles from phone -->
                            <path d=\"M140 70 L120 60 L120 80 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">I forgot</text>
                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">all about</text>
                            
                            <path d=\"M140 100 L115 95 L115 105 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <rect x=\"65\" y=\"85\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"90\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cannot...</text>
                            
                            <path d=\"M140 120 L100 115 L100 125 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"105\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"75\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">...Remember</text>
                            
                            <path d=\"M140 140 L110 135 L110 145 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <rect x=\"70\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"90\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">...Wait</text>
                            
                            <path d=\"M235 70 L260 60 L260 80 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <rect x=\"260\" y=\"40\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">...Believe</text>
                            
                            <!-- Human ear icon -->
                            <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"110\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M270 95 C280 95, 285 100, 285 110 C285 120, 280 125, 275 130 C270 135, 265 130, 265 125 C265 120, 270 120, 270 115 C270 110, 265 110, 265 105 C265 100, 268 95, 270 95 Z\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- AI Technology -->
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"180\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"191\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI LINGUISTICS</text>
                            
                            <!-- Gear icons -->
                            <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"180\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M130 175 L130 185 M125 180 L135 180\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M125 175 L135 185 M125 185 L135 175\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"180\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <path d=\"M270 175 L270 185 M265 180 L275 180\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M265 175 L275 185 M265 185 L275 175\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                            
                            <!-- AI Related Terms -->
                            <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NLP</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"160\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LLM</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#333\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NLG</text>
                            
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"20\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Understanding Language with AI</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">AI linguistics enables devices to understand, process, and respond to human language through various technologies like NLP, LLMs, and NLG.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Key AI Linguistic Technologies</h3>
                        <p>AI linguistics encompasses several specialized technologies that enable computers to work with human language:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Natural Language Processing (NLP):</strong> Enables computers to understand and interpret human language</li>
                            <li><strong>Large Language Models (LLMs):</strong> Advanced AI systems trained on vast amounts of text that can understand and generate human-like language</li>
                            <li><strong>Natural Language Generation (NLG):</strong> A subfield focused on creating coherent text output from structured data</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>These technologies work together to power the language capabilities in modern AI systems, enabling everything from virtual assistants to automated content creation.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>While these technologies have complex inner workings, their purpose is straightforward: to bridge the gap between how humans communicate and how computers process information. By making machines capable of understanding and producing human language, AI linguistics has created new possibilities for human-computer interaction.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"nlp\">
                    <h2>Natural Language Processing (NLP)</h2>
                    <p>Natural Language Processing, or NLP, is a large branch of AI that empowers computers to understand and react to human language. It is like sorting through a huge library of books—categorizing them, summarizing their content, and knowing exactly where to find the information you need.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Bookshelf -->
                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#8B4513\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Disorganized Books (left) -->
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"70\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"95\" y=\"65\" width=\"25\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"75\" width=\"10\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"130\" y=\"60\" width=\"20\" height=\"55\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"70\" width=\"15\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Arrow -->
                            <path d=\"M180 100 L220 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                            <polygon points=\"220,100 214,95 214,105\" fill=\"#333\"></polygon>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Processing -->
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NLP</text>
                            
                            <!-- Organized Books (right) -->
                            <rect x=\"230\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"245\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"260\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"275\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"290\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"305\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            <rect x=\"320\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- NLP Tasks -->
                            <rect x=\"70\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"167\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Translation</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"140\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"170\" y=\"167\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sentiment Analysis</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"210\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"240\" y=\"167\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Speech Recognition</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"310\" y=\"167\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Topic Segmentation</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connections -->
                            <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Labels -->
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Unstructured Language</text>
                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Organized Information</text>
                            
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Natural Language Processing</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">NLP transforms unstructured human language into organized information through various processing tasks.</p>
                    </div>

                    <p>NLP involves several tasks such as translation, sentiment analysis, speech recognition and topic segmentation. These capabilities enable computers to interpret and respond to human language in increasingly sophisticated ways.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>NLP in Action</h3>
                        <p>Natural Language Processing powers many everyday technologies:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Autocorrect and Predictive Text:</strong> When your phone corrects typos or suggests the next word as you type</li>
                            <li><strong>Virtual Assistants:</strong> When Siri or Alexa understands your spoken commands</li>
                            <li><strong>Email Filters:</strong> When your inbox automatically categorizes messages or identifies spam</li>
                            <li><strong>Search Engines:</strong> When a search engine understands what you\'re looking for despite typos or ambiguity</li>
                            <li><strong>Social Media Analysis:</strong> When platforms analyze sentiment in posts or comments</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>At the end of the day, these systems convert our language into something they can recognize. They are constantly searching for matches in their databases, but they don\'t truly comprehend our language in the way humans do.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"llm\">
                    <h2>Large Language Models (LLMs)</h2>
                    <p>Advancing further beyond basic NLP, we encounter Large Language Models, or LLMs, which represent a more sophisticated use of AI in language. These powerful models are trained on vast text collections and can perform complex tasks requiring contextual understanding.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- LLM Blimp -->
                            <ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></ellipse>
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LLM</text>
                            
                            <!-- Tethers from LLM -->
                            <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Topic Icons -->
                            <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"140\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">♫</text>
                            <text x=\"140\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Music</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">▣</text>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sports</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"220\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✈</text>
                            <text x=\"220\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Travel</text>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"260\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">📷</text>
                            <text x=\"260\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Photography</text>
                            
                            <!-- Campfire Scene (Human Conversation) -->
                            <path d=\"M80 185 C85 175, 90 180, 95 185\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                            <ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"190\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#8B4513\"></ellipse>
                            <ellipse cx=\"95\" cy=\"190\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#8B4513\"></ellipse>
                            <ellipse cx=\"87\" cy=\"195\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#8B4513\"></ellipse>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"180\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"67\" y=\"190\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"180\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"102\" y=\"190\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            
                            <circle cx=\"87\" cy=\"165\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></circle>
                            <rect x=\"84\" y=\"175\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#666\"></rect>
                            
                            <!-- Speech Bubbles -->
                            <ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></ellipse>
                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"163\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text>
                            
                            <ellipse cx=\"115\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></ellipse>
                            <text x=\"115\" y=\"163\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">あ</text>
                            
                            <ellipse cx=\"87\" cy=\"140\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></ellipse>
                            <text x=\"87\" y=\"143\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connection from Conversation to LLM -->
                            <path d=\"M90 150 C120 130, 150 100, 170 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                            
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Large Language Models</text>
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Capable of discussing multiple topics and languages like a well-traveled individual</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Large Language Models can discuss a wide variety of topics and languages, similar to having a conversation with a knowledgeable individual.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>What Makes LLMs Powerful</h3>
                        <p>Large Language Models represent a significant advancement in AI linguistics because they:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Process Massive Text Data:</strong> Trained on trillions of words from books, websites, and articles</li>
                            <li><strong>Have Contextual Understanding:</strong> Can maintain coherence across long pieces of text</li>
                            <li><strong>Demonstrate Transfer Learning:</strong> Can apply knowledge from one domain to another</li>
                            <li><strong>Generate High-Quality Text:</strong> Produce human-like writing with appropriate structure and style</li>
                            <li><strong>Adapt to Different Tasks:</strong> Can be used for translation, summarization, content creation, and more</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>For instance, imagine a well-travelled individual who can recount tales and converse in various languages. An LLM also has an extensive array of texts and can discuss a multitude of topics, giving the impression of conversing with a seasoned traveller.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"nlg\">
                    <h2>Natural Language Generation (NLG)</h2>
                    <p>A subfield of NLP is Natural Language Generation, or NLG. This specialised branch of AI gives computers the ability to craft text that is not only understandable but also contextually relevant. It is the driving force behind the creation of various text content.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                            <!-- Central Tree (Growing Text) -->
                            <rect x=\"195\" y=\"160\" width=\"10\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#8B4513\"></rect>
                            <ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"120\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\"></ellipse>
                            
                            <!-- Text formed in tree -->
                            <text x=\"175\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">The</text>
                            <text x=\"190\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">quick</text>
                            <text x=\"215\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">brown</text>
                            <text x=\"170\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">fox</text>
                            <text x=\"185\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">jumps</text>
                            <text x=\"215\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">over</text>
                            <text x=\"180\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">the</text>
                            <text x=\"195\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">lazy</text>
                            <text x=\"215\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333\">dog</text>
                            
                            <!-- Data Input -->
                            <rect x=\"70\" y=\"110\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Structured Data</text>
                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Temperature: 75°F)</text>
                            
                            <!-- NLG Process -->
                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"83\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NLG</text>
                            
                            <!-- Output Example -->
                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"110\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"320\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Natural Text</text>
                            <text x=\"320\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\"It\'s 75 degrees out.\"</text>
                            
                            <!-- Content Types -->
                            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"180\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"90\" y=\"193\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Weather Reports</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"130\" y=\"180\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"160\" y=\"193\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Financial Updates</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"180\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"230\" y=\"193\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sports Recaps</text>
                            
                            <rect x=\"270\" y=\"180\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"193\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Product Descriptions</text>
                            
                            <!-- Connections -->
                            <path d=\"M110 110 C130 90, 160 80, 180 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            <path d=\"M220 100 C240 80, 270 90, 290 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                            
                            <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,1\"></line>
                            <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,1\"></line>
                            
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Natural Language Generation</text>
                        </svg>
                        <p class=\"caption\">Natural Language Generation transforms structured data into human-readable text for various applications.</p>
                    </div>

                    <p>Imagine a journalist who writes articles on many topics. They collect information, organize their thoughts, and then write a story. NLG operates in a similar fashion, but it is a system that processes data and weaves it into a narrative, be it a financial summary, a weather forecast, or a product description.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"info-box\">
                        <h3>NLG vs. LLMs: Understanding the Difference</h3>
                        <p>While NLG focuses on generating new text from structured data, LLMs are designed to produce text that is meaningful and contextually fitting across a wider range of inputs and uses:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>NLG:</strong> Typically works with specific data inputs (like weather readings, sports statistics) to create standardized outputs</li>
                            <li><strong>LLMs:</strong> Can handle open-ended prompts and generate varied responses based on their extensive training</li>
                            <li><strong>NLG:</strong> Often used for business reporting, data summarization, and automated content creation</li>
                            <li><strong>LLMs:</strong> Used for creative writing, conversation, answering questions, and many other language tasks</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>This distinction highlights the impressive abilities of large language models, which go beyond the typical functions of natural language generation.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>Both approaches have their place in AI linguistics, with NLG providing focused, data-driven text generation and LLMs offering more versatile and contextual language capabilities. Many modern AI systems combine elements of both to deliver the best possible language experience.</p>
                </section>

                <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"applications\">
                    <h2>Real-World Applications</h2>
                    <p>AI linguistics powers numerous tools and services that have become integral to our daily lives. From personal assistants to creative writing aids, these technologies are transforming how we interact with computers and information.</p>
                    
                    <div class=\"image-container\">
                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"240\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 240\">
                            <!-- Central Element -->
                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"120\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>
                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Linguistics</text>
                            
                            <!-- Microsoft Copilot -->
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"50\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Microsoft Copilot</text>
                            <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- GitHub Copilot -->
                            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"150\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"120\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GitHub Copilot</text>
                            <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Virtual Assistants -->
                            <rect x=\"240\" y=\"50\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                            <text x=\"280\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Virtual Assistants</text>
                            <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                            
                            <!-- Translation Services -->
                            <rect x=\"240\" y=\"150\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
