                    <div class=\"key-concept\">
                        <h3>Business and Professional Applications</h3>
                        <p>Text-to-image AI offers valuable solutions across various professional domains:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Marketing and Advertising:</strong> Creating custom visuals for campaigns, social media, and promotional materials</li>
                            <li><strong>Product Design:</strong> Visualizing product concepts and variations before production</li>
                            <li><strong>Content Creation:</strong> Generating illustrations for articles, blogs, and presentations</li>
                            <li><strong>Education:</strong> Creating visual aids, diagrams, and concept illustrations for learning materials</li>
                            <li><strong>UX/UI Design:</strong> Quickly generating mockups and interface elements</li>
                            <li><strong>Real Estate:</strong> Visualizing property renovations or staging possibilities</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p>Beyond professional uses, text-to-image AI is also empowering individual creativity. Artists can use it for inspiration or to explore variations on their ideas. Writers can visualize scenes from their stories. Hobbyists can create unique graphics for personal projects. The democratization of image creation through AI means that visual expression is no longer limited by technical skill—the only limit is your imagination.</p>
                    
                    <p>So, the next time you need an image, remember that the power of AI is just a description away. With tools like DALL·E and Microsoft Designer, you can bring your visual ideas to life with just a few well-crafted words.</p>
                </section>
            </div>', '214', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('16', '2', 'Chapter 2.15: AI Companion in Content Creation', 'Exploring the ways AI tools help in creating and refining various forms of content', 'chapter5_15', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to AI in Content Creation</h2>
        <p>Generative AI is changing the way we interact with digital content. It is a fusion of art and science, where algorithms and data collaborate to create new and innovative outputs across multiple media formats.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Brain Network -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Neurons -->
                <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"90\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"80\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"100\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"140\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"195\" cy=\"155\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"145\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"120\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Connections -->
                <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"185\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                <line x1=\"215\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                <line x1=\"195\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                <line x1=\"165\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></line>
                
                <!-- Content Icons -->
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"40\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"125\" y=\"62\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T</text>
                
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"150\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"125\" y=\"172\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-music\"></i></text>
                
                <rect x=\"260\" y=\"40\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"275\" y=\"62\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-image\"></i></text>
                
                <rect x=\"260\" y=\"150\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"275\" y=\"172\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-film\"></i></text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Generative AI connects algorithms and data to create various forms of content from text to video.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>In this chapter, we\'ll explore different types of generative AI tools that serve as companions in content creation, assisting users in developing textual, visual, audio, and video content with unprecedented ease and creativity.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"text-based-ai\">
        <h2>Text-Based Generative AI</h2>
        <p>Text-based generative AI uses advanced models to generate coherent and contextually relevant text-based responses. It\'s like having a virtual writing companion at your fingertips, capable of assisting you in composing emails, articles, or even finding the best restaurants in your area.</p>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Microsoft Copilot: A Text-Generation Example</h3>
            <p>Microsoft Copilot exemplifies text-based generative AI, allowing users to create various forms of written content quickly and efficiently. Whether you need help drafting an email, creating a report, or brainstorming ideas, Copilot can assist by generating text that matches your requirements.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Laptop/Device -->
                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"60\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"70\" width=\"180\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#ddd\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Text Content -->
                <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                
                <!-- Woman at laptop -->
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"80\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"110\" width=\"10\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"330\" y=\"110\" width=\"10\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Icons floating -->
                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"350\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">@</text>
                
                <rect x=\"370\" cy=\"70\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"377\" y=\"82\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">#</text>
                
                <polygon points=\"330,40 340,55 320,55\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></polygon>
                <text x=\"330\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">♥</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Text-based AI tools assist in drafting content from emails to social media posts and beyond.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Real-World Example: Volunteer Outreach</h3>
            <p>Imagine you want to find ways to give back to your community. You love volunteering, especially helping others, but are overwhelmed by the amount of available information. With Microsoft Copilot, you could:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Ask for non-profit organizations that support people with vision disabilities in your city</li>
                <li>Have Copilot draft an introduction email to a non-profit about their volunteer process</li>
                <li>Generate a structured outline for volunteer opportunities that match your availability and skills</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"visual-generation\">
        <h2>Text-to-Image Generation</h2>
        <p>Text-to-image generative AI allows users to describe a scene through text and have AI bring it to life visually. This type of AI interprets text descriptions to create images, making it an invaluable tool for everyday imagination and design tasks.</p>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Text to Image Concept -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"70\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Arrow -->
                <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <polygon points=\"200,100 190,95 190,105\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                
                <!-- Image Result -->
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"100\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Bus in Image -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"90\" width=\"90\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"270\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"135\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"135\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Bird on Bus -->
                <path d=\"M 290 80 Q 300 70, 310 80 T 330 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"75\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></circle>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Text-to-image AI transforms descriptive text into visual representations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>DALL·E Integration in Microsoft Designer</h3>
            <p>AI models like DALL·E are integrated into Microsoft Designer, which is a feature within Image Creator in Microsoft Copilot. By inputting a description, Microsoft Designer leverages DALL·E to turn conceptual ideas into virtual reality, allowing for creative visualization without advanced design skills.</p>
        </div>

        <p>For example, if you\'re creating a birthday invitation for your child\'s upcoming fifth birthday with a \"rainbow giraffe\" theme, you might struggle to find such specific decorations. Using Copilot\'s creative style, you could generate a custom image of a rainbow giraffe with the number 5, creating a unique design element for the invitation.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"audio-video-ai\">
        <h2>Audio and Video Generative AI</h2>
        <p>Generative AI isn\'t limited to text and images. Advanced models can now create audio content and even generate or enhance video content, opening new possibilities for multimedia creation.</p>

        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Audio Generative AI</h3>
            <p>This form of AI can compose music or generate realistic sound effects. It can even replicate human voices for podcasts or virtual assistants, all from a set of parameters or a piece of text. Emerging applications enable users to record a sample of their own voice, which the system can accurately replicate to create extended audio segments or even entire songs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Audio Generation Illustration -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"40\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Sound Wave -->
                <path d=\"M 80 90 Q 100 60, 120 90 T 160 90 T 200 90 T 240 90 T 280 90 T 320 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                
                <!-- Microphone -->
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"15\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"67\" cy=\"60\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"67\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"67\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <path d=\"M 57 110 Q 67 120, 77 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                
                <!-- Speaker -->
                <rect x=\"330\" y=\"65\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M 350 65 L 360 55 L 360 105 L 350 95 Z\" fill=\"#333\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 365 70 Q 375 80, 365 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 370 65 Q 385 80, 370 95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Audio generative AI creates or replicates sounds, music, and voices from input parameters.</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Video Generative AI</h3>
        <p>Video generative AI technology can create video content by learning from existing footage. It can animate characters, replicate environments, and even generate educational tutorials. This technology has practical applications like remastering old video footage to preserve and share memories with loved ones.</p>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 150\">
                <!-- Video Transformation -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"55\" y=\"55\" width=\"90\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"75\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"60\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Arrow -->
                <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <polygon points=\"210,80 200,75 200,85\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                
                <!-- Enhanced Video -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"35\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"235\" y=\"40\" width=\"110\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"265\" cy=\"70\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"50\" width=\"25\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Video generative AI can transform, enhance, or create new video content from existing footage or descriptions.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>', '215', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('17', '2', 'Chapter 2.16: New Opportunities with Generative AI', 'How AI is reshaping careers, learning, and workforce development', 'chapter6_16', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to AI-Driven Opportunities</h2>
        <p>Throughout history, technological advancements have continually transformed the workforce, creating new opportunities and even entirely new roles. From horse-drawn carriages to cars, from manual calculation to computers, each technological shift has reshaped how we work and interact.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Historical Technology Evolution -->
                <rect x=\"30\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"120\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Factory Equipment -->
                <rect x=\"40\" y=\"80\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"120\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"120\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"45\" y=\"70\" width=\"30\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Steamship -->
                <path d=\"M 130 100 L 170 100 L 160 120 L 140 120 Z\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></path>
                <rect x=\"140\" y=\"80\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Desktop Computer -->
                <rect x=\"220\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"225\" y=\"75\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Mobile Phone -->
                <rect x=\"315\" y=\"75\" width=\"30\" height=\"45\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"320\" y=\"80\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"115\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\"></circle>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Technological advancements have continually transformed how we work and live.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>AI now serves as the latest catalyst for change, forging new avenues in creativity, problem-solving, empathy, and leadership—domains where human capabilities excel, and machines traditionally fall short. Our labor market, historically riddled with inefficiencies and inequalities, is on the cusp of an AI-driven revolution that holds the potential to rectify disparities and redefine the structure of economic opportunity.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>AI-Powered Transformation</h3>
            <p>Generative AI is creating new opportunities by enhancing human creativity, redefining problem-solving approaches, and opening up possibilities for career advancement that didn\'t exist before. Rather than simply automating existing jobs, AI is creating entirely new categories of work.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"career-opportunities\">
        <h2>AI as a Career Navigator</h2>
        <p>AI acts like a compass for your career, guiding you through the job market\'s twists and turns. You can use it as a tool to analyze available jobs and the skills they require, helping you determine what you should learn next to stay competitive in a rapidly evolving job market.</p>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Person with Compass/Map -->
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"100\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"120\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"130\" width=\"10\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"130\" width=\"10\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Compass -->
                <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Maze -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"70\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <path d=\"M 350 70 L 350 130 L 230 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">AI helps navigate career paths and identify opportunities in a complex job landscape.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Real World Example: Career Transition</h3>
            <p>Imagine you\'re a software developer who has been in your role for five years and are interested in transitioning to a managerial position. You\'re not sure what skills are needed for this transition. Using Microsoft Copilot, you can:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Identify the key skills needed for the transition from technical to managerial roles</li>
                <li>Find specific training resources on platforms like Microsoft Learn or LinkedIn Learning</li>
                <li>Create a personalized development plan with timeframes and measurable goals</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p>This approach is a game-changer because it makes career advice accessible to everyone, anytime. It enables you to interact with AI about your career path, providing answers and resources more quickly than traditional methods. It\'s all about ensuring you have the right tools to build the career you want.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"learning-pathways\">
        <h2>AI-Enhanced Learning Opportunities</h2>
        <p>AI is not just a tool for automation; it is a platform for innovation and learning opportunities. It is transforming the way we learn by providing personalized educational experiences and access to information on a scale never seen before.</p>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Person with Laptop -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"90\" y=\"120\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Laptop -->
                <rect x=\"140\" y=\"90\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"150\" y=\"100\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect>
                <text x=\"180\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Login</text>
                
                <!-- Learning Icons -->
                <rect x=\"250\" y=\"70\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"265\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text>
                
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"70\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"315\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">あ</text>
                
                <rect x=\"250\" y=\"120\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"265\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">🍎</text>
                
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"120\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"315\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{x+y}</text>
                
                <!-- Paper Airplane -->
                <path d=\"M 215 110 L 240 90 L 240 130 Z\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">AI provides personalized learning experiences across various subjects and skills.</p>
        </div>

        <p>With AI, learning becomes more interactive, adaptive, and tailored to individual needs and interests. As we embrace the concept of lifelong learning, AI opens new avenues for personal and professional growth. It can identify gaps in our knowledge and suggest resources to fill them.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Personalized Learning Paths</h3>
            <p>AI can analyze a learner\'s strengths, weaknesses, interests, and goals to create customized learning paths. It can connect individuals with experts and mentors worldwide, and even help discover new passions and career opportunities that align with their natural abilities.</p>
        </div>

        <p>For individuals who have always had to adapt and learn to overcome challenges, AI is a powerful ally. It levels the playing field by giving everyone access to the same high-quality resources and opportunities, regardless of background or circumstances.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"workforce-impact\">
        <h2>Transforming the Workforce Landscape</h2>
        <p>In this era of constant change, AI ensures that our journey of learning is not just a path we follow but a road we pave for ourselves, leading to a future where every individual has the chance to reach their full potential.</p>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Uneven Hill to Level Ground -->
                <path d=\"M 50 150 Q 100 100, 150 150 T 250 100 T 350 150\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- City Skyline -->
                <rect x=\"260\" y=\"80\" width=\"20\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"270\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"290\" y=\"90\" width=\"25\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"110\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"320\" y=\"70\" width=\"15\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Highway -->
                <path d=\"M 50 170 L 350 170\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"5\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 60 170 L 80 170\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 100 170 L 120 170\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 140 170 L 160 170\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 180 170 L 200 170\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 220 170 L 240 170\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 260 170 L 280 170\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 300 170 L 320 170\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></path>
                
                <!-- Heavy Equipment -->
                <rect x=\"120\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"120\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"140\" y=\"100\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"150\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"150\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">AI helps level the playing field and create new opportunities for workforce advancement.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Creating a More Equitable Future</h3>
            <p>AI is not just changing jobs; it\'s reshaping the entire concept of work. By automating routine tasks, AI frees humans to focus on what they do best: creative thinking, emotional intelligence, ethical decision-making, and interpersonal connection. This shift creates opportunities for:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>People previously excluded from the workforce due to various barriers</li>
                <li>Workers looking to transition to more fulfilling and higher-value roles</li>
                <li>Those seeking to balance work with caregiving, education, or other life priorities</li>
                <li>Communities historically left behind by technological revolutions</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p>As we navigate this transformation, it\'s crucial to approach AI adoption with a focus on inclusivity, ensuring that the benefits of these technologies are accessible to all segments of society. The road ahead is being paved with new skills, new roles, and new ways of working that prioritize human wellbeing and fulfillment alongside productivity and innovation.</p>
        
        <p>By understanding how AI is reshaping opportunities and actively engaging with these technologies, we can help create a future of work that is more equitable, sustainable, and aligned with human potential and purpose.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '216', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('18', '3', 'Chapter 3.17: The Evolution of Search', 'From books to AI-powered reasoning engines', 'chapter1_17', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Search Evolution</h2>
        <p>Before the Internet, when someone had a question, they could not simply turn to their mobile phone or computer for an answer. Instead, they had to search through physical books to find reliable information.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Person thinking -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"80\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"90\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Question mark -->
                <path d=\"M 130 70 Q 140 50, 150 70 Q 160 90, 140 90 L 140 100\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"></path>
                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"110\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Stack of books -->
                <rect x=\"200\" y=\"70\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"80\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"195\" y=\"90\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"205\" y=\"100\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"110\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Clock -->
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"85\" r=\"25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Sleeping person with books -->
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"295\" y=\"165\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <rect x=\"270\" y=\"165\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M 295 150 L 290 150 L 290 145 L 295 145 Z\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Before the internet, finding answers required tedious research through physical books and could take hours.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>This task could take hours, depending on how close the local library was or whether the person had access to books at home. Nowadays, we can access information within seconds. This dramatic change in information accessibility is thanks to the evolution of search technologies.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"early-search\">
        <h2>The Early Days of Digital Search</h2>
        <p>The journey of search technology began in the 1970s, when Microsoft started with a vision to put \"a computer on every desk and in every home.\" This was the start of personal computing, setting the stage for the future of search.</p>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Timeline -->
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                
                <!-- 1970s -->
                <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <text x=\"80\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1970s</text>
                <text x=\"80\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Microsoft Founded</text>
                
                <!-- 1990s -->
                <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <text x=\"160\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1990s</text>
                <text x=\"160\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MSN Emerged</text>
                
                <!-- 1996 -->
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1996</text>
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Windows NT 4.0</text>
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Indexing Service</text>
                
                <!-- 2009 -->
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <text x=\"320\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2009</text>
                <text x=\"320\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bing Launch</text>
                
                <!-- MSN & Bing Logos -->
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"40\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                <text x=\"150\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MSN</text>
                
                <rect x=\"290\" y=\"40\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>
                <text x=\"310\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bing</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The evolution of Microsoft\'s search technologies from the 1970s to Bing\'s launch in 2009.</p>
        </div>

        <p>Two decades later, the Microsoft Network (MSN) emerged, signalling a new digital era. Then, in 1996, a significant breakthrough occurred with the launch of Windows NT 4.0, which introduced the Indexing Service. This innovation allowed for indexing of web content and text searches through Internet Information Services (IIS) servers.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>The Indexing Service</h3>
            <p>The Indexing Service in Windows NT 4.0 was a pioneering technology that enabled the cataloging and searching of content on a computer or network. It created indexes of documents similar to how a book\'s index works, allowing for faster and more efficient searches of file contents rather than just filenames.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>IIS servers are flexible, secure, and manageable web servers for hosting a variety of web content. The introduction of the Indexing Service marked a significant step towards a more efficient search experience, transforming how users could find information digitally.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"modern-search\">
        <h2>The Rise of Modern Search Engines</h2>
        <p>In the early 2000s, MSN Search started using its own search algorithms, and by 2004 it began displaying its own search results. The pace of progress quickened, and in 2009, Microsoft unveiled Bing, a search engine designed to empower users to not only find but also comprehend information from the web.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Computer -->
                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"70\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"80\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#ddd\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"180\" y=\"190\" width=\"40\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Bing Search Bar -->
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"100\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"155\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\">giraffe</text>
                <circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"115\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"252\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"252\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Search Results -->
                <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Searching on Bing became intuitive: users simply type a query and the search engine quickly returns relevant results.</p>
        </div>

        <p>Searching on Bing is straightforward. You simply type a query and Bing searches the web for matching results, presenting them in an instant. For example, you could open Microsoft Edge, navigate to bing.com and ask: \"How is the weather in New York City today?\" Bing would promptly retrieve the answer.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"ai-search\">
        <h2>The AI Revolution in Search</h2>
        <p>Today, Bing has evolved with new features that integrate AI capabilities. At the end of a weather report, for instance, you might notice options to ask follow-up questions like \"How humid is it?\" or \"What is the chance of rain?\" By selecting one of these questions, you transition to the Microsoft Copilot experience, previously known as Bing Chat.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>From Search Engines to Reasoning Engines</h3>
            <p>During this transition, you are witnessing the reinvention of search. The new Copilot icon represents a shift from traditional search engines to AI-powered reasoning engines. While a search engine finds information, a reasoning engine understands and interprets information, paving the way for a more intelligent and interactive future of search.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Search Engine vs Reasoning Engine -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"70\" width=\"140\" height=\"100\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Search Engine</text>
                <!-- Linear results representation -->
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"70\" width=\"140\" height=\"100\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Reasoning Engine</text>
                <!-- Connected concept representation -->
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"100\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"110\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"140\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"130\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>
                <!-- Connections -->
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The distinction between a search engine (finding information) and a reasoning engine (understanding and interpreting information).</p>
        </div>

        <p>Microsoft Copilot is more than a search engine—it\'s a reasoning engine. It provides search results, comprehensive answers, and an innovative chat experience, all designed to deliver the answers you need more swiftly.</p>
        
        <p>From encyclopedias to a generative AI-powered experience like Copilot, the journey of search is a testament to human innovation and our quest for knowledge. This evolution marks a profound shift in how we access, process, and understand information in our daily lives.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '317', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('19', '3', 'Chapter 3.18: How Does a Search Engine Work?', 'Exploring the mechanics behind search engines', 'chapter2_18', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Search Engines</h2>
        <p>Search engines have become an integral part of our daily lives, helping us find information from simple facts to detailed research. They also allow us to stay informed on the latest news, shop online, or plan trips by providing keywords and straightforward queries.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Person with headphones -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"80\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"90\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <!-- Headphones -->
                <path d=\"M 80 80 C 70 60, 130 60, 120 80\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path>
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"120\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Laptop -->
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"90\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"135\" y=\"95\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Cloud with icons -->
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"80\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"70\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"110\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"100\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Icons inside cloud -->
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"75\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"230\" y=\"79\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-globe\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"95\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"255\" y=\"99\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"105\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"230\" y=\"109\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog\"></i></text>
                
                <rect x=\"315\" y=\"70\" width=\"35\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"320\" y=\"75\" width=\"25\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"332.5\" cy=\"125\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"></circle>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Search engines connect users to a vast world of information with just a few keywords.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>There\'s a world of information at your fingertips, but what really goes on behind the scenes when you use a search engine? It all starts with three fundamental tasks: crawling, indexing, and ranking.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"crawling\">
        <h2>Crawling: Discovering Web Content</h2>
        <p>Search engines deploy programs known as crawlers or web spiders to find new or updated web pages. These crawlers explore the web by following links from one page to another, discovering new or updated pages to add to the search index.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Web structure -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"104\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Page A</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"150\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Page B</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"150\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"154\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Page C</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"80\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"70\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Page D</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"80\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"330\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Page E</text>
                
                <!-- Connections between pages -->
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Spider -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"215\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"215\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Spider web threads -->
                <path d=\"M 200 75 L 200 100\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 190 65 L 120 150\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 210 65 L 280 150\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 185 60 L 70 80\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 215 60 L 330 80\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Web crawlers (or spiders) navigate from one webpage to another by following links, discovering new content to index.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Web Crawlers</h3>
            <p>Web crawlers, sometimes called spiders or bots, are automated programs that systematically browse the World Wide Web. They visit web pages, read their content, and follow links to discover new pages. This process is essential for search engines to maintain an up-to-date database of available web content.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>As crawlers visit websites, they collect information about each page\'s content, links, and structure. This information is then passed to the next stage of the search engine process: indexing.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"indexing\">
        <h2>Indexing: Organizing the Data</h2>
        <p>Once the content is found through crawling, it\'s time for indexing. Here, the data found is catalogued in a massive database called the search index.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Filing System -->
                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"50\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <!-- File folders -->
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"115\" y=\"60\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.9\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"160\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"165\" y=\"60\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.9\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"215\" y=\"60\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.9\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"260\" y=\"60\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"265\" y=\"60\" width=\"20\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.9\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Binders -->
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"150\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"175\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"195\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"215\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"260\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"100\" width=\"15\" height=\"60\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Search Index Label -->
                <rect x=\"160\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"45\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Search Index</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The indexing process organizes web content like a vast library catalog for quick retrieval.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Like a librarian organizing books on shelves, search engines categorize and organize the collected information in a way that makes it easily retrievable. This organization is crucial because it allows the search engine to quickly find relevant information when a user submits a query.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>How Indexing Works</h3>
            <p>The search index is like a detailed map of the internet. It contains information about each webpage, including:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>The words and phrases that appear on the page</li>
                <li>The frequency and location of these words</li>
                <li>The structure of the page (headings, links, etc.)</li>
                <li>Metadata about the page (title, description, etc.)</li>
                <li>Links to and from the page</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This information is stored in a highly optimized database that enables rapid searching and retrieval.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Without proper indexing, finding relevant information would be like searching for a specific book in a library with no organizational system. The indexing process transforms raw web data into a structured format that makes the final stage of search—ranking—possible.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"ranking\">
        <h2>Ranking: Delivering Relevant Results</h2>
        <p>When you ask a question or enter a search query, the search engine sifts through its indexed content, prioritizing pages to ensure you get the most relevant answers. This process is known as ranking.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Search bar -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"70\" width=\"300\" height=\"40\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"80\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\">What are the best pizza restaurants in Seattle?</text>
                <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"90\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"330\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i></text>
                
                <!-- Search results -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"120\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#ccc\"></rect>
                <text x=\"65\" y=\"137\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">1. 20 best pizza restaurants in Seattle</text>
                
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"150\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#ccc\"></rect>
                <text x=\"65\" y=\"167\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">2. Where to get the best pizza in Seattle</text>
                
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"180\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#ccc\"></rect>
                <text x=\"65\" y=\"197\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\">3. Seattle food guide - pizza edition</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Search engines rank results based on relevance, placing the most useful answers at the top.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Ranking involves complex algorithms that consider factors such as the frequency and location of keywords within the web page, the overall quality of the content, and the analysis of links. The goal is to present users with the most relevant and useful information for their specific query.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Ranking Factors</h3>
            <p>Modern search engines consider hundreds of factors when ranking search results, including:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Relevance of content to the search query</li>
                <li>Quality and authority of the webpage</li>
                <li>User location and search history</li>
                <li>Device type (mobile vs. desktop)</li>
                <li>Page load speed and user experience</li>
                <li>Freshness of content (especially for time-sensitive topics)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>Let\'s put this into perspective with a practical example. Say you\'re searching for \"Italian restaurants in my city.\" The search engine springs into action, suggesting a list of websites. This selection is not random; it\'s the result of precise ranking, where each page\'s relevance is assessed based on your search.</p>
        
        <p>From the moment you type in your query to how quickly the results appear, you\'re seeing the seamless dance of crawling, indexing, and ranking. It\'s a journey that brings knowledge to your fingertips, all in the blink of an eye.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '318', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('20', '3', 'Chapter 3.19: Reasoning Engines', 'Understanding AI-powered reasoning engines and how they transform search', 'chapter3_19', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Reasoning Engines</h2>
        <p>Most of us are familiar with search engines like Bing. We type in a query and instantly we are presented with a list of web pages that might have the answer we\'re looking for. But there is another type of engine that works differently than a search engine, called the reasoning engine.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Bing search page -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"60\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" rx=\"7.5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"95\" width=\"80\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"105\" width=\"90\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"115\" width=\"70\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"110\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Search Engine</text>
                
                <!-- Magnifying glass -->
                <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"80\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Reasoning engine representation -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"60\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <!-- Brain-like pattern -->
                <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"80\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"75\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"85\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"100\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"105\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"95\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <!-- Connections -->
                <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <text x=\"290\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Reasoning Engine</text>
                
                <!-- Light bulb -->
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"80\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M 320 90 L 320 95\" stroke=\"#FBD44B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 316 92 L 324 92\" stroke=\"#FBD44B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 315 70 L 325 70 L 325 85 C 325 90, 315 90, 315 85 Z\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#FBD44B\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">While search engines find information, reasoning engines interpret and understand it.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>A reasoning engine is a system that applies logic and inference to draw conclusions, make decisions, summarize information, or solve problems based on data and knowledge. Reasoning engines offer more elaborate responses compared to traditional search engines.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Defining Reasoning Engines</h3>
            <p>A reasoning engine is an AI-powered system that goes beyond finding relevant information (like a search engine) to actually understand, interpret, and synthesize information. It can assist with tasks like writing parts of a grant proposal, providing ideas for a project, researching a topic, or analyzing data in a file. Some reasoning engines can even generate images from text descriptions.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"reasoning-vs-search\">
        <h2>Search Engines vs. Reasoning Engines</h2>
        <p>To understand the difference between search engines and reasoning engines, let\'s examine how they approach user queries and what kind of results they produce.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"250\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 250\">
                <!-- Split view -->
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></line>
                
                <!-- Search Side -->
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Search Engine</text>
                
                <!-- Search Input -->
                <rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Giraffe</text>
                
                <!-- Search Results -->
                <rect x=\"40\" y=\"100\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#ccc\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                
                <!-- Reasoning Side -->
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Reasoning Engine</text>
                
                <!-- Reasoning Input -->
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"60\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tell me about giraffes</text>
                
                <!-- Reasoning Results -->
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"100\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#ccc\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"250\" y=\"110\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.1\"></rect>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Giraffes are the tallest</text>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">living terrestrial animals.</text>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">They have spotted coats,</text>
                
                <!-- Comparison arrows -->
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"210\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lists of relevant pages</text>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"210\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Synthesized answer</text>
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"230\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Find information</text>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"230\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Understand &amp; create</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Search engines return links to relevant pages, while reasoning engines provide synthesized answers and can create new content.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Key Differences Between Search and Reasoning Engines</h3>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Search Engines</th>
                    <th>Reasoning Engines</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Return lists of web pages</td>
                    <td>Provide direct, synthesized answers</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Focus on finding information</td>
                    <td>Focus on understanding and interpreting</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Match keywords to content</td>
                    <td>Apply logic and inference to content</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>User must navigate to websites</td>
                    <td>User gets comprehensive answer directly</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Primarily retrieval-based</td>
                    <td>Combines retrieval with generation</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>
        
        <p>While search engines excel at finding existing information across the web, reasoning engines can analyze, synthesize, and even create new content based on that information. This represents a fundamental shift in how we interact with and obtain information from digital systems.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"how-reasoning-works\">
        <h2>How Reasoning Engines Work</h2>
        <p>A reasoning engine starts with a foundation of knowledge. It is fed a variety of data, from text to code, and it might even absorb information across the web. This is considered the pre-training phase, where the engine learns language patterns, grammar, and facts.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Engine illustration -->
                <rect x=\"120\" y=\"70\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Input section -->
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"100\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#333\" opacity=\"0.3\"></line>
                <text x=\"95\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Knowledge</text>
                
                <!-- Engine internals -->
                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"120\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"130\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"140\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <!-- Connections -->
                <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"210\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Output section -->
                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"95\" width=\"60\" height=\"50\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M 290 105 L 330 105 M 290 115 L 330 115 M 290 125 L 330 125 M 290 135 L 330 135\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.3\"></path>
                <text x=\"310\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Insights</text>
                
                <!-- Input flow -->
                <path d=\"M 125 120 C 135 120, 135 120, 135 120\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"></path>
                
                <!-- Output flow -->
                <path d=\"M 265 120 C 275 120, 275 120, 275 120\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"></path>
                
                <!-- Arrowhead marker -->
                <defs>
                    <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"10\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\">
                        <polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                    </marker>
                </defs>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Reasoning engines process knowledge through neural networks to produce insights and answers.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>During the next phase, the engine relies on the guidance of human supervisors to steer its learning journey. These supervisors guide the engine through the complexities of language, ensuring it understands not just the what, but the why behind the words.</p>
        
        <p>When you ask a question, the reasoning engine springs to life. It sifts through its learned knowledge, weighing words and considering context. It\'s not just about finding an answer, but about creating an answer that is informative, relevant, and engaging.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>The Question-Answer Process</h3>
            <p>When you submit a query to a reasoning engine, it follows these general steps:</p>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Understanding</strong>: It analyzes your question to understand what you\'re really asking</li>
                <li><strong>Retrieval</strong>: It searches its knowledge base for relevant information</li>
                <li><strong>Reasoning</strong>: It applies logic and inference to connect pieces of information</li>
                <li><strong>Generation</strong>: It creates a comprehensive response tailored to your query</li>
                <li><strong>Refinement</strong>: It checks its answer for accuracy and relevance</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <p>The journey also doesn\'t have to end with one query or response. With every interaction, the reasoning engine learns and adapts to answer your questions based on the prompt you give it. It\'s a continuous cycle of learning and evolving, striving to understand and communicate more effectively.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"applications\">
        <h2>Applications and Future Potential</h2>
        <p>As we continue to explore and innovate, reasoning engine experiences like Microsoft Copilot are opening new possibilities for user creativity in generating text, images, and other media. They are not just changing the way we search for information, but also how we interact, learn, and create in the digital world.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Various application scenarios -->
                <!-- Writer -->
                <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"75\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"65\" y=\"85\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"90\" y=\"85\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <!-- Campfire -->
                <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"110\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M 70 110 L 90 110 L 80 95 Z\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                
                <!-- Messenger -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"75\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"185\" y=\"85\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"85\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <!-- Bird with letter -->
                <path d=\"M 190 50 Q 200 40, 210 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4BFB9D\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"195\" y=\"35\" width=\"10\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Programmer -->
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"75\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"305\" y=\"85\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"330\" y=\"85\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <!-- Computer -->
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"40\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"305\" y=\"45\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect>
                <text x=\"320\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{}</text>
                
                <!-- Phone user -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"155\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"185\" y=\"165\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"165\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <!-- Phone -->
                <rect x=\"195\" y=\"125\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"196\" y=\"127\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Connecting lines -->
                <path d=\"M 110 80 C 130 80, 170 80, 170 80\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 230 80 C 250 80, 290 80, 290 80\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 200 110 C 200 120, 200 130, 200 130\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                
                <!-- Copilot Logo at center -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Reasoning engines like Copilot enable new forms of creativity and productivity across various contexts.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Some key applications of reasoning engines include:</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Practical Applications of Reasoning Engines</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Content Creation</strong>: Helping write articles, reports, emails, and creative content</li>
                <li><strong>Research Assistance</strong>: Gathering, summarizing, and synthesizing information on complex topics</li>
                <li><strong>Programming Support</strong>: Assisting with code generation, debugging, and optimization</li>
                <li><strong>Educational Tools</strong>: Creating personalized learning materials and explanations</li>
                <li><strong>Visual Creation</strong>: Generating images, diagrams, and visual content from descriptions</li>
                <li><strong>Decision Support</strong>: Analyzing data and providing insights to aid decision-making</li>
                <li><strong>Language Translation</strong>: Providing contextually accurate translations between languages</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>As reasoning engines continue to evolve, they will likely become even more integrated into our daily digital interactions, offering increasingly sophisticated assistance with complex cognitive tasks. The boundary between search and reasoning will continue to blur, creating a more intuitive and helpful digital experience for users worldwide.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '319', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('21', '3', 'Chapter 3.20: A New Way to Search: Microsoft Copilot', 'Exploring Microsoft Copilot\'s capabilities as an AI-powered search companion', 'chapter4_20', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Microsoft Copilot</h2>
        <p>Microsoft Copilot is changing the way we interact with digital information, transforming the traditional search experience into a comprehensive one. It combines the power of a large language model with the vast knowledge of the internet to provide an AI-powered companion that helps users find information, solve problems, and create content more efficiently.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Copilot logo symbol -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>
                
                <!-- Web of connections -->
                <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Connected elements -->
                <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-graduation-cap\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"130\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"270\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-bar\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"130\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"270\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-wrench\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"30\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-pencil-alt\"></i></text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Microsoft Copilot connects AI capabilities with various tasks and knowledge domains.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Retrieval-Augmented Generation</h3>
            <p>Microsoft Copilot uses a method called retrieval-augmented generation, which combines the analytical power of large language models with real-time information retrieval from the internet. This ensures you receive the best assistance while searching, providing both up-to-date information and intelligent synthesis of that information.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>As an AI-powered companion, Copilot adapts to your needs, enabling you to work smarter and build faster. It\'s designed to be your everyday AI companion, helping with a wide range of tasks from answering complex questions to generating creative content.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"technology\">
        <h2>The Technology Behind Copilot</h2>
        <p>Microsoft Copilot combines the power of a large language model (LLM) with the vast knowledge of the internet. This combination enables Copilot to provide responses that are both informed by the latest information and shaped by sophisticated AI understanding.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- LLM and Web Knowledge Integration -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"70\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"110\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Large Language</text>
                <text x=\"110\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Model</text>
                
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"70\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"110\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"290\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Web</text>
                <text x=\"290\" y=\"135\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Knowledge</text>
                
                <!-- Integration arrows -->
                <path d=\"M 175 110 L 225 110\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"></path>
                
                <!-- Combined output -->
                <rect x=\"140\" y=\"160\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"185\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Microsoft Copilot</text>
                
                <!-- Output arrows -->
                <path d=\"M 110 155 L 160 160\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 290 155 L 240 160\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                
                <!-- Arrowhead marker -->
                <defs>
                    <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"10\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\">
                        <polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                    </marker>
                </defs>
                
                <!-- Labels -->
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Retrieval-Augmented Generation</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Copilot combines large language models with web knowledge retrieval for comprehensive responses.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Unlike traditional search engines that simply match keywords to web pages, Copilot goes deeper by understanding the context and intent behind your queries. This contextual understanding allows it to provide results that are not just relevant but tailored to the specific task at hand.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>How Copilot Processes Your Queries</h3>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Understanding</strong>: Copilot analyzes your query to understand your intent and the context</li>
                <li><strong>Retrieval</strong>: It searches the web for the most relevant and up-to-date information</li>
                <li><strong>Processing</strong>: The large language model processes this information, applying reasoning and synthesis</li>
                <li><strong>Response</strong>: Copilot generates a comprehensive, contextual response that addresses your specific needs</li>
                <li><strong>Learning</strong>: It improves over time by learning from interactions, becoming more helpful and accurate</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <p>This advanced integration of technologies enables Copilot to offer a fundamentally different search experience—one that doesn\'t just find information but helps you understand, use, and act on that information more effectively.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"features\">
        <h2>Key Features of Microsoft Copilot</h2>
        <p>Microsoft Copilot offers a range of capabilities that elevate it beyond traditional search engines. These features are designed to make finding and using information more intuitive, efficient, and productive.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Contextual Understanding</h3>
            <p>Copilot goes beyond keyword matching to understand the context and intent behind your queries. This means it can provide results that are not just relevant but tailored to the specific task at hand, such as planning a trip, researching a topic, or solving a problem.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Feature grid -->
                <!-- Row 1 -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Improved Accuracy</text>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Precise, relevant results</text>
                
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Clear Communication</text>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Easy-to-understand answers</text>
                
                <!-- Row 2 -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"130\" width=\"140\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Content Generation</text>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Create text, code, and visuals</text>
                
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"130\" width=\"140\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Problem Solving</text>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Solutions backed by data</text>
                
                <!-- Icons -->
                <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"75\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"70\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"75\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"230\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-comment\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"155\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"70\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-pen\"></i></text>
                
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"155\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"230\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><i class=\"fas fa-puzzle-piece\"></i></text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Microsoft Copilot offers a suite of powerful features that transform how we search for and use information.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Additional key features of Microsoft Copilot include:</p>
        
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Summarization</strong>: Copilot can condense large volumes of information into concise summaries, saving you time and helping you quickly grasp the key takeaways.</li>
            <li><strong>Question Answering</strong>: From simple factual queries to complex problem-solving, Copilot provides clear, accurate answers to help you make informed decisions.</li>
            <li><strong>Creative Content</strong>: Copilot can generate poems, stories, or other creative content based on prompts, making it a valuable tool for writers and creatives.</li>
            <li><strong>Fine-tuning</strong>: If you have existing content that needs refining, Copilot can help rewrite, improve, or optimize it, ensuring your message is clear and impactful.</li>
            <li><strong>Visual Insights</strong>: Copilot can create and analyze images, providing insights and generating visual content that aligns with your goals.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>With these capabilities, Copilot serves as a versatile assistant that can help you with a wide range of tasks, from research and writing to creative exploration and problem-solving.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"examples\">
        <h2>Practical Examples of Using Copilot</h2>
        <p>To better understand how Microsoft Copilot can enhance your information-seeking experience, let\'s explore some practical examples of how it can be used in everyday scenarios.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Example 1: Trip Planning</h3>
            <p>Imagine you\'re planning a trip to Japan in spring. You might ask Copilot:</p>
            <p><em>\"I am planning a trip to Japan next spring. What should I know about spring in Japan before my visit?\"</em></p>
            <p>Instead of receiving a list of websites to visit, Copilot might provide a comprehensive response like:</p>
            <p><em>\"Spring in Japan is famous for its cherry blossom season. It\'s a great time to visit parks and temples and take part in Hanami festivals. Make sure to check the local bloom forecasts, as the timing can vary each year.\"</em></p>
            <p>This direct answer saves you time and provides precisely the information you need.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Solar panel scenario -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"60\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                
                <!-- House with solar panels -->
                <rect x=\"80\" y=\"100\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                <polygon points=\"80,100 105,70 130,100\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></polygon>
                <rect x=\"95\" y=\"120\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Solar panels -->
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"85\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"90\" y=\"85\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"85\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Copilot response bubble -->
                <rect x=\"150\" y=\"80\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.1\"></rect>
                <polygon points=\"150,110 140,115 150,120\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.1\"></polygon>
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Recent studies have shown that</text>
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">perovskite solar cells are achieving</text>
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">efficiencies above 25%...</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Copilot provides up-to-date, relevant information on topics like solar energy efficiency.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Other practical examples include:</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Example 2: Research Assistance</h3>
            <p>When researching solar energy efficiency, you might ask: <em>\"What is the latest research on solar energy efficiency?\"</em></p>
            <p>Copilot would provide a concise summary of recent developments, such as: <em>\"Recent studies have shown that perovskite solar cells are achieving efficiencies above 25%, making them a promising technology for future panels.\"</em></p>
        </div>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Example 3: Meeting Notes Summarization</h3>
            <p>After a sales meeting, you could provide Copilot with your notes and ask: <em>\"Summarize the key points shared from the Sales meeting on July 13.\"</em></p>
            <p>Copilot would organize the information into a clear summary: <em>\"Sales Meeting Summary - July 13: Q1 revenue increased by 15%, 25 new clients acquired, next quarter goals include expanding into the European market.\"</em></p>
        </div>
        
        <p>These examples demonstrate how Copilot transforms the search experience from simply finding information to actively helping you understand and use that information. It\'s not just a tool for answering questions, but a companion for achieving your goals more efficiently and effectively.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '320', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('22', '3', 'Chapter 3.21: Prompt Engineering', 'Mastering the art of crafting effective prompts for AI systems', 'chapter5_21', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Prompt Engineering</h2>
        <p>The way we interact with AI has transformed. We have moved beyond simple commands and queries to a more sophisticated method of communication known as prompt engineering.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Command prompt style screen -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"130\" height=\"100\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#000\"></rect>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0f0\">C:\\&gt; search weather</text>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0f0\">C:\\&gt; find restaurants</text>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0f0\">C:\\&gt; locate nearest gas</text>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0f0\">C:\\&gt; _</text>
                
                <!-- Arrow indicating evolution -->
                <path d=\"M 200 100 L 220 100\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"></path>
                
                <!-- Modern prompt interface -->
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"50\" width=\"130\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"250\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">Create a detailed weekend</text>
                <text x=\"250\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">itinerary for Seattle with</text>
                <text x=\"250\" y=\"100\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">outdoor activities, considering</text>
                <text x=\"250\" y=\"115\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">possible rain and a toddler.</text>
                
                <!-- Title headers -->
                <text x=\"115\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Simple Commands</text>
                <text x=\"305\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Engineered Prompt</text>
                
                <!-- Arrowhead marker -->
                <defs>
                    <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"10\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\">
                        <polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                    </marker>
                </defs>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The evolution from simple commands to sophisticated, contextual prompts in AI interaction.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>What is Prompt Engineering?</h3>
            <p>Prompt engineering is the art of crafting prompts that guide an LLM-based generative AI to produce a desired response. It\'s about communicating with AI systems in a way that helps them understand exactly what you\'re looking for, resulting in more accurate, useful, and tailored responses.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Much like a sculptor working with marble to reveal a masterpiece within, prompt engineers craft their queries to bring out the best possible responses from AI systems. As we advance in the use of LLM-based generative AI, the art of prompt engineering becomes increasingly important. It\'s not just about asking; it\'s about how we ask.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"what-is-prompt\">
        <h2>Understanding Prompts</h2>
        <p>A prompt is the input you give to a generative AI experience, like Microsoft Copilot, telling it what you want it to do and how. Think of it as your communication tool with the AI system.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Prompt components diagram -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Instruction component -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Instruction</text>
                
                <!-- Context component -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Context</text>
                
                <!-- Description arrows -->
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <text x=\"335\" y=\"63\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">What to do</text>
                
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#4BFB9D\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <text x=\"335\" y=\"163\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">How to do it</text>
                
                <!-- Envelope metaphor -->
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"90\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M 70 90 L 100 110 L 130 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></path>
                <path d=\"M 70 130 L 95 110 L 130 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">A prompt consists of two main components: instruction (what to do) and context (how to do it).</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>A prompt consists of two main components:</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Components of a Prompt</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Instruction</strong>: The written part of the prompt that states the task and the objective. It should be clear and specific, so the AI knows exactly what you expect from it.</li>
                <li><strong>Context</strong>: Provides information for the response such as the intended audience and the desired tone. It should be relevant and appropriate, so the AI can tailor its response to your needs.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>Once a prompt is submitted, the AI reads the text in chunks called tokens, which can be as short as a single character or a word. This is important because every model has a limit on the amount of text it can process at once. This is why it\'s important to keep our prompts concise and to the point.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Example of a Well-Structured Prompt</h3>
            <p><strong>Instruction:</strong> \"Create a comprehensive, professional guide for adult learners\"</p>
            <p><strong>Context:</strong> \"on how to effectively network in their industry, with a focus on digital platforms\"</p>
            <p>This prompt clearly states what is needed (a comprehensive guide) and provides context about the audience (adult learners), the topic (networking in their industry), and a specific focus (digital platforms).</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"crafting-prompts\">
        <h2>Crafting Effective Prompts</h2>
        <p>Crafting effective prompts is both an art and a science. It requires understanding what you want to achieve and communicating it clearly to the AI system.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"250\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 250\">
                <!-- Marble block to statue metaphor -->
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"80\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#333\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Arrow -->
                <path d=\"M 180 130 L 220 130\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"></path>
                
                <!-- Statue outline -->
                <path d=\"M 280 80 L 270 85 Q 260 100, 270 120 L 270 160 Q 280 180, 300 170 Q 320 180, 330 160 L 330 120 Q 340 100, 330 85 L 320 80 Z\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#333\"></path>
                <ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"70\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#333\"></ellipse>
                
                <!-- Chisel and hammer -->
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"50\" width=\"40\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" transform=\"rotate(45, 130, 50)\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"155\" y=\"25\" width=\"30\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\" transform=\"rotate(45, 155, 25)\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Labels -->
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"210\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Raw Query</text>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"210\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Refined Result</text>
                
                <!-- Arrowhead marker -->
                <defs>
                    <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"10\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\">
                        <polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></polygon>
                    </marker>
                </defs>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Prompt engineering is like sculpting: starting with raw material and refining it to reveal the desired form.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>When you\'re prepared to engage with an AI system like Copilot, it\'s important to select the appropriate style for your task and craft your prompt carefully. Here\'s a step-by-step guide to crafting effective prompts:</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Steps for Crafting Effective Prompts</h3>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Define Your Objective</strong>: Clearly identify what you want to achieve with your prompt. Are you looking for information, creative content, technical assistance, or something else?</li>
                <li><strong>Choose the Right Style</strong>: Select the appropriate conversation style based on your needs:
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>More Creative</strong>: For brainstorming, storytelling, or creative content</li>
                        <li><strong>More Balanced</strong>: For everyday queries requiring both information and creativity</li>
                        <li><strong>More Precise</strong>: For factual information, technical questions, or academic research</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li><strong>Craft Clear Instructions</strong>: Explicitly state what you want the AI to do. Use action verbs like \"create,\" \"analyze,\" \"explain,\" or \"summarize.\"</li>
                <li><strong>Provide Relevant Context</strong>: Include any necessary background information, audience considerations, format requirements, or tone preferences.</li>
                <li><strong>Review and Refine</strong>: Before submitting, review your prompt to ensure it clearly communicates your intent and includes all necessary information.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <p>Let\'s examine a sample prompt to see these principles in action:</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Sample Prompt Analysis</h3>
            <p><em>\"Please create a comprehensive, professional guide for adult learners on how to effectively network in their industry, with a focus on digital platforms.\"</em></p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Instruction</strong>: \"Create a comprehensive, professional guide\" (Clear action with quality specifications)</li>
                <li><strong>Context</strong>: \"for adult learners\" (Target audience)
                <br>\"on how to effectively network in their industry\" (Main topic)
                <br>\"with a focus on digital platforms\" (Specific emphasis)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"prompt-processing\">
        <h2>How AI Processes Prompts</h2>
        <p>Understanding how AI systems process prompts can help you craft more effective ones. When you submit a prompt, the AI breaks it down into tokens and analyzes it before generating a response.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Tokenization visualization -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"60\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f9f9f9\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Sample text with token boundaries -->
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\">Create a guide for networking</text>
                
                <!-- Token boundaries -->
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"90\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"80\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Create</text>
                
                <rect x=\"105\" y=\"90\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"110\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a</text>
                
                <rect x=\"120\" y=\"90\" width=\"35\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"137\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">guide</text>
                
                <rect x=\"160\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"170\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">for</text>
                
                <rect x=\"185\" y=\"90\" width=\"45\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"207\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">network</text>
                
                <rect x=\"235\" y=\"90\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.2\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"247\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ing</text>
                
                <!-- Processing step labels -->
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tokenization Process</text>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The AI breaks your prompt into tokens for processing</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">AI systems process prompts by breaking them into tokens, which may be whole words or parts of words.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Tokens are the segments of text that the model uses to comprehend and formulate responses. They can be complete words or fragments of words. For example, \"network\" is one token, while \"networking\" may be divided into \"network\" and \"ing\" based on the model\'s tokenization method.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>The Prompt Processing Workflow</h3>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Tokenization</strong>: The AI divides your prompt into tokens (words or word parts)</li>
                <li><strong>Interpretation</strong>: It analyzes these tokens to understand your request</li>
                <li><strong>Context Building</strong>: It establishes the context based on your prompt</li>
                <li><strong>Response Generation</strong>: It creates a response that addresses your specific needs</li>
                <li><strong>Review</strong>: It checks the response for relevance and accuracy</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <p>Once Copilot delivers its output, examine it to verify it aligns with your objectives. If it doesn\'t quite hit the mark, you can refine your prompt and resubmit it to achieve a more precise outcome. This process helps you collaborate more effectively with AI systems over time.</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Tips for Optimizing Prompt Processing</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Keep your prompts clear and direct to minimize misinterpretation</li>
                <li>Use specific language to guide the AI toward your desired outcome</li>
                <li>Break complex requests into simpler components</li>
                <li>If the response isn\'t what you expected, try rephrasing your prompt</li>
                <li>Learn from successful prompts and apply those patterns to future interactions</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>By understanding how AI processes your prompts, you can craft them more effectively to get the best possible results. The key to a successful interaction lies in the clarity of your instruction and the relevance of your context.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '321', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('23', '3', 'Chapter 3.22: Prompt Engineering', 'The art of crafting effective prompts for AI systems', 'chapter6_22', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Prompt Engineering</h2>
        <p>The way we interact with AI has transformed dramatically in recent years. We\'ve moved beyond simple commands and queries to a more sophisticated method of communication known as prompt engineering.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Command Prompt Screen -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Courier New\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#00FF00\">$ query user_data</text>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Courier New\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#00FF00\">$ run analysis</text>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Courier New\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#00FF00\">$ show results</text>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Courier New\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#00FF00\">$ clear_cache</text>
                <text x=\"60\" y=\"120\" font-family=\"Courier New\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#00FF00\">$ exit</text>
                
                <!-- Arrow showing transformation -->
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                <polygon points=\"220,90 215,85 215,95\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></polygon>
                
                <!-- Copilot Interface -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"290\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Copilot</text>
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"70\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\"></rect>
                <text x=\"245\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#333333\">Please analyze my data and provide insights on customer behavior trends...</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The evolution from basic commands to sophisticated prompt engineering</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>What is Prompt Engineering?</h3>
            <p>Prompt engineering is the art of crafting prompts that guide a large language model (LLM) based generative AI to produce a desired response. By designing precise instructions with relevant context, users can effectively communicate their needs to AI systems like Microsoft Copilot.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>A prompt is the input you give to a generative AI experience, telling it what you want it to do and how. The quality and specificity of your prompt directly influences the quality and relevance of the AI\'s response. As we continue to integrate AI into our daily workflows, understanding the principles of prompt engineering becomes increasingly valuable.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"understand-prompts\">
        <h2>Understanding Prompts</h2>
        <p>A well-constructed prompt consists of two essential elements: the instruction and the context. These components work together to guide the AI in generating a response that meets your specific needs.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Instruction Circle -->
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" fill=\"rgba(75, 110, 251, 0.2)\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Montserrat\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Instruction</text>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What to do</text>
                
                <!-- Context Circle -->
                <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" fill=\"rgba(251, 75, 75, 0.2)\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Montserrat\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Context</text>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Why and how</text>
                
                <!-- Connecting Line -->
                <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Examples -->
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">\"Draft an email\"</text>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">\"Generate a project plan\"</text>
                
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">\"For a new client\"</text>
                <text x=\"280\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">\"Using professional tone\"</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The two main components of an effective prompt: instruction and context</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Instruction</h3>
        <p>The instruction is the written part of the prompt that clearly states the task and objective. It should be specific and direct, telling the AI exactly what you want it to do. Examples include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>\"Draft an email to a client\"</li>
            <li>\"Generate a project management plan\"</li>
            <li>\"Summarize this article\"</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Context</h3>
        <p>The context provides additional information that helps the AI customize its response to your specific needs. This might include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Intended audience (e.g., \"for technical professionals\")</li>
            <li>Desired tone (e.g., \"casual and friendly\" or \"formal and professional\")</li>
            <li>Format preferences (e.g., \"in bullet points\" or \"as a table\")</li>
            <li>Any specific constraints or requirements</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Tokenization: How AI Processes Your Prompt</h3>
            <p>When you submit a prompt, Copilot reads text in chunks called tokens, which can be as short as a single character or as long as a word. Every model has a token limit—a maximum amount of text it can process at once. This is why keeping prompts concise and to the point is important for optimal results.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"craft-prompts\">
        <h2>Crafting Effective Prompts</h2>
        <p>Let\'s walk through the process of crafting an effective prompt step by step, using Microsoft Copilot as an example.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Background with marble texture suggestion -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"360\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Block of marble -->
                <rect x=\"40\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#E0E0E8\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#C0C0C8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#C0C0C8\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#C0C0C8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>
                <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#C0C0C8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#C0C0C8\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Sculptor\'s tools and hands suggestion -->
                <rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#A06040\" rx=\"2\"></rect> <!-- Chisel handle -->
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"70\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#C0C0C0\" rx=\"1\"></rect> <!-- Chisel blade -->
                
                <!-- Sculpture/Statue result -->
                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"40\" width=\"80\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" rx=\"5\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>
                <text x=\"320\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Montserrat\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Refined</text>
                <text x=\"320\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"Montserrat\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Prompt</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Crafting a prompt is like sculpting: refining raw materials into a precise form</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Step 1: Understand Your Objective</h3>
        <p>Before crafting your prompt, be clear about what you want to achieve. Are you looking for information, seeking creative content, requesting analysis, or something else? Understanding your goal will help you structure your prompt effectively.</p>
        
        <h3>Step 2: Choose the Appropriate Conversation Style</h3>
        <p>Microsoft Copilot offers three conversation styles to match your needs:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>More Creative:</strong> Ideal for brainstorming, storytelling, and generating novel ideas</li>
            <li><strong>More Balanced:</strong> Good for everyday tasks that require both information and creativity</li>
            <li><strong>More Precise:</strong> Best for fact-finding, technical queries, and situations requiring accuracy</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Step 3: Structure Your Prompt</h3>
        <p>Combine clear instructions with helpful context. For example:</p>
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Example Prompt</h3>
            <p>\"Please create a comprehensive, professional guide for adult learners on how to effectively network in their industry, with a focus on digital platforms.\"</p>
            <p><strong>Instruction:</strong> \"Create a comprehensive, professional guide\"</p>
            <p><strong>Context:</strong> \"for adult learners on how to effectively network in their industry, with a focus on digital platforms\"</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"submit-review\">
        <h2>Submitting and Reviewing</h2>
        <p>After crafting your prompt, it\'s time to submit it and evaluate the response.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Submit icon -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <polygon points=\"85,100 115,80 115,120\" fill=\"white\"></polygon>
                
                <!-- Processing icon -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"185\" y=\"85\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Review icon -->
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"80\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"285\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"285\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The process of submitting, processing, and reviewing AI responses</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Step 4: Submit Your Prompt</h3>
        <p>Click the send button to submit your prompt to Copilot. The AI will process your request, breaking it down into tokens and generating a response based on its understanding of your instructions and context.</p>
        
        <h3>Step 5: Review the Response</h3>
        <p>Once Copilot delivers its response, take time to review it carefully:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Is the content aligned with your objective?</li>
            <li>Does it address all aspects of your request?</li>
            <li>Is the tone, format, and level of detail appropriate?</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Step 6: Refine and Iterate</h3>
        <p>If the response doesn\'t fully meet your needs, you can refine your prompt and try again. This iterative process helps you develop stronger prompt engineering skills over time. You might:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Add more specific instructions</li>
            <li>Provide additional context</li>
            <li>Clarify ambiguous points</li>
            <li>Request a different format or approach</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Understanding Tokens</h3>
            <p>Tokens are the segments of text that the model uses to comprehend and formulate responses. Words like \"network\" might be one token, while longer words like \"networking\" might be divided into multiple tokens (e.g., \"network\" and \"ing\"). Understanding this can help you optimize your prompts for better results.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>', '322', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('24', '3', 'Chapter 3.23: Best Practices in Prompting', 'Optimizing your interactions with AI through effective prompting techniques', 'chapter7_23', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Prompting Best Practices</h2>
        <p>Refining your prompt crafting skills can significantly enhance your effectiveness with Microsoft Copilot and other AI systems. Just as a chef follows a recipe to create a delicious meal, following best practices in prompting can help you achieve optimal results from your AI interactions.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Recipe Book -->
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <text x=\"110\" y=\"52\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#333333\">Recipe</text>
                
                <!-- Baking Ingredients -->
                <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></circle> <!-- Flour -->
                <rect x=\"200\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect> <!-- Sugar -->
                <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"140\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#A06040\"></circle> <!-- Chocolate -->
                <ellipse cx=\"240\" cy=\"70\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse> <!-- Egg -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"100\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></rect> <!-- Spice -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"130\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect> <!-- Mint -->
                
                <!-- Oven with Cupcakes -->
                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"70\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#666666\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"290\" y=\"80\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Finished Cupcakes -->
                <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#A06040\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M285,170 C285,165 295,165 295,170\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></path>
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#A06040\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M315,170 C315,165 325,165 325,170\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\"></path>
                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#A06040\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M345,170 C345,165 355,165 355,170\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Using the right ingredients and techniques for perfect results—in baking and in prompting</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>The Recipe for Effective Prompting</h3>
            <p>Just like a good recipe, effective prompting starts with understanding the key components:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Clear Objective:</strong> What do you need from the AI?</li>
                <li><strong>Context:</strong> Why do you need it and how will you use the information?</li>
                <li><strong>Source:</strong> Is there any known information Copilot should use or reference?</li>
                <li><strong>Expectations:</strong> What format or audience do you want the response tailored to?</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>By following established best practices, you can maximize the value of your interactions with AI systems and achieve more precise, relevant, and useful responses. Let\'s explore the key techniques that will help you become proficient in the art of prompting.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"key-techniques\">
        <h2>Key Techniques for Effective Prompting</h2>
        <p>Implementing these fundamental techniques will significantly improve your results when working with AI systems like Microsoft Copilot.</p>
        
        <h3>Be Specific</h3>
        <p>The more details you offer in your prompt, the better Copilot can tailor its service to your needs. Vague instructions lead to vague results.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Simple Dragon Sketch -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M80,80 Q100,60 120,80 Q130,90 120,100 Q100,110 80,100 Q70,90 80,80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Arrow -->
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                <polygon points=\"220,90 215,85 215,95\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></polygon>
                
                <!-- Detailed Dragon Illustration -->
                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M260,70 Q280,50 300,70 Q310,80 300,90 Q305,95 310,100 Q295,110 280,100 Q265,105 260,100 Q255,95 260,90 Q250,80 260,70\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M300,70 L320,60 L325,65 L305,75 Z\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M300,90 L320,100 L315,105 L295,95 Z\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M260,100 Q240,120 230,115 Q235,105 260,90\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Adding details transforms a simple request into a specific one with better results</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Example of Being Specific</h3>
            <p><strong>Vague:</strong> \"Create a dragon\"</p>
            <p><strong>Specific:</strong> \"Create an image of a red dragon perched atop a mountain at sunset, with wings spread wide and golden eyes glowing in the fading light.\"</p>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Prioritize Accuracy</h3>
        <p>When precision is important, make sure to guide Copilot with clear and concise prompts. Whether it\'s summarizing a specific article or explaining a complex concept, the right prompt ensures an accurate response.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Target with arrow -->
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Arrow hitting bullseye -->
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <polygon points=\"120,90 130,82 126,79\" fill=\"#333333\"></polygon>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Prompt phrase -->
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"70\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Precise Prompt</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">A well-targeted prompt hits the bullseye for accurate results</p>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Customize Your Experience</h3>
        <p>Copilot is versatile, catering to both novices and experts alike. Frame your questions to suit your level of understanding, from simple explanations to tackling advanced topics.</p>

        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Ice Cream Base -->
                <path d=\"M150,120 L130,60 C130,50 170,50 170,60 L150,120\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M150,120 L150,150 L145,155 L155,155 L150,150\" fill=\"#A06040\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <!-- Toppings - Basic -->
                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"50\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Ingredients -->
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"40\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></circle> <!-- Chocolate -->
                <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"40\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle> <!-- Berry -->
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"40\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\"></circle> <!-- Mint -->
                <path d=\"M240,80 Q250,70 260,80 L260,100 L240,100 Z\" fill=\"#A06040\"></path> <!-- Chocolate piece -->
                <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle> <!-- Berry -->
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"80\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\"></rect> <!-- Mint leaf -->
                
                <!-- Fancy Ice Cream -->
                <path d=\"M280,120 L260,60 C260,50 300,50 300,60 L280,120\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M280,120 L280,150 L275,155 L285,155 L280,150\" fill=\"#A06040\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"55\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"55\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"275\" cy=\"50\" width=\"10\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M265,50 Q280,30 295,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A06040\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Customizing your prompts adds richness and specificity to AI responses</p>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Control the Length</h3>
        <p>You have the power to set the length of Copilot\'s responses. If you need more information, just prompt Copilot to elaborate. Similarly, if you want concise answers, specify that in your prompt.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"130\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 130\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"130\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Tape measures -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Larger tape measure -->
                <rect x=\"200\" y=\"40\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"210\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"340\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"55\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"55\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Text labels -->
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Concise</text>
                <text x=\"275\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Detailed</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">You can control the length of responses from brief summaries to detailed explanations</p>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Embrace Variety</h3>
        <p>Copilot is not limited to text. It can present information in tables, outlines, and even diagrams, enriching your experience with a visual dimension that goes beyond mere words. Be explicit about the format you want in your prompt.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Using Different Content Formats</h3>
            <p>You can specifically request various formats in your prompts:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>\"Present this data in a table format\"</li>
                <li>\"Organize this information as a step-by-step process\"</li>
                <li>\"Create a comparison chart for these options\"</li>
                <li>\"Format this as a bullet-point summary\"</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"conversation-styles\">
        <h2>Choosing the Right Conversation Style</h2>
        <p>Microsoft Copilot offers three distinct conversation styles to cater to your specific needs. Selecting the appropriate style can significantly enhance the relevance and utility of Copilot\'s responses.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Creative Style -->
                <rect x=\"40\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"85\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"Montserrat\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Creative</text>
                <circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"80\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M75,80 Q85,65 95,80 Q105,95 85,100 Q65,95 75,80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Balanced Style -->
                <rect x=\"155\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"Montserrat\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Balanced</text>
                <!-- Scale icon -->
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <rect x=\"185\" y=\"90\" width=\"30\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></rect>
                <path d=\"M185,90 L175,110 L195,110 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></path>
                <path d=\"M215,90 L205,110 L225,110 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></path>
                <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"225\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"225\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"225\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Precise Style -->
                <rect x=\"270\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"315\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"Montserrat\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Precise</text>
                <!-- Target icon -->
                <circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"90\" r=\"25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"90\" r=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"90\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Choose the conversation style that best matches your current needs</p>
        </div>

        <h3>More Creative</h3>
        <p>Perfect for brainstorming, ideation, storytelling, and content creation. This style encourages novel and imaginative responses.</p>
        <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Writing assistance, idea generation, creative projects, brainstorming sessions</p>
        
        <h3>More Balanced</h3>
        <p>Offers a healthy mix of creativity and factual information. This style is ideal for everyday tasks that require both information and a touch of creativity.</p>
        <p><strong>Best for:</strong> General questions, planning, personal development, learning new topics</p>
        
        <h3>More Precise</h3>
        <p>Focuses on accuracy and factual information. This style prioritizes precision and is ideal for research or technical inquiries.</p>
        <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Fact-finding, technical questions, data analysis, academic research</p>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Selecting the Right Style for Your Task</h3>
            <p>Consider what you\'re trying to accomplish:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Writing a science fiction story? Choose \"More Creative\"</li>
                <li>Planning a work project? \"More Balanced\" offers the perfect harmony</li>
                <li>Researching historical facts? \"More Precise\" will serve you well</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"practical-examples\">
        <h2>Practical Examples and Applications</h2>
        <p>Let\'s explore some practical examples of how to implement these best practices in your interactions with Microsoft Copilot.</p>
        
        <h3>Email Drafting Example</h3>
        <p>Imagine you need to send out an email to your team about a project update, but you\'re running short on time:</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Laptop -->
                <rect x=\"120\" y=\"70\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"80\" width=\"140\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"170\" width=\"20\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#666666\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Outlook interface suggestion -->
                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"80\" width=\"140\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                <text x=\"145\" y=\"91\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Microsoft Outlook</text>
                <rect x=\"135\" y=\"100\" width=\"130\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></rect>
                <text x=\"140\" y=\"108\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333333\">To: Team</text>
                <rect x=\"135\" y=\"115\" width=\"130\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></rect>
                <text x=\"140\" y=\"123\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"#333333\">Subject: Project Update</text>
                <rect x=\"135\" y=\"130\" width=\"130\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Clock -->
                <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"90\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"90\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Copilot Icon -->
                <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"90\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></circle>
                <text x=\"330\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Copilot</text>
                <line x1=\"285\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <polygon points=\"305,90 300,85 300,95\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></polygon>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Using Copilot to efficiently draft emails when time is limited</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Example Prompt for Email Drafting</h3>
            <p>\"Compose a concise, professional, and appreciative email to my team. The email should celebrate our completion of the design phase, announce the transition to the development phase of our mobile app project, and encourage continued hard work. Please keep it to the point.\"</p>
            <p><strong>Key Elements:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Clear instruction: \"Compose... an email\"</li>
                <li>Style specification: \"concise, professional, and appreciative\"</li>
                <li>Content requirements: celebrate, announce, encourage</li>
                <li>Length constraint: \"keep it to the point\"</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Other Practical Applications</h3>
        <p>These best practices can be applied to a wide range of scenarios:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Research Summaries:</strong> \"Summarize the key findings from this research paper on climate change, focusing on actionable recommendations for policymakers.\"</li>
            <li><strong>Content Refinement:</strong> \"Transform the sentence: \'Our company sells good products\' into a more impactful statement for our website homepage.\"</li>
            <li><strong>Coding Assistance:</strong> \"Create a function to generate a Fibonacci sequence in Python, with comments explaining each step of the algorithm.\"</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Remember, effective prompting is rooted in the clarity and specificity of your questions as well as the thoughtful construction of your requests. With these best practices, you will harness the full potential of Microsoft Copilot, making every interaction more productive and enjoyable.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '323', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('25', '4', 'Chapter 4.24: Using AI Responsibly: Best Practices', 'Guidelines for ethical and beneficial AI interactions', 'chapter1_24', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Responsible AI Use</h2>
        <p>As AI becomes more integrated into our lives, it\'s important to ask: how can we ensure it is used responsibly? This chapter explores the best practices for ethical and beneficial AI interactions.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- People using devices -->
                <ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse>
                <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"70\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"65\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                
                <ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"110\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse>
                <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"80\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"145\" y=\"120\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                
                <ellipse cx=\"240\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse>
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"70\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"225\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Devices with AI -->
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"105\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"80\" y=\"122\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>
                
                <rect x=\"140\" y=\"115\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"160\" y=\"132\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>
                
                <rect x=\"220\" y=\"105\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"122\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>
                
                <!-- Question mark thinking about responsible use -->
                <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <text x=\"320\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"60\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">?</text>
                
                <path d=\"M130,90 Q140,70 150,90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M210,80 Q220,60 230,80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M270,90 Q290,70 310,80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">As AI becomes more ubiquitous, responsible use becomes increasingly important</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Why Responsible AI Matters</h3>
            <p>Responsible AI use is more than just a technical consideration—it\'s essential for ensuring that AI technologies benefit humanity, protect individual rights, and avoid potential harms. By following best practices, we can harness AI\'s potential while mitigating risks.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>This chapter will guide you through the key aspects of using AI responsibly, from understanding the basics of how AI works to implementing concrete measures for safety, privacy, and ethical use. These guidelines apply whether you\'re interacting with AI as an individual user, a developer, or part of an organization implementing AI solutions.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"understanding-ai\">
        <h2>Understanding AI: The First Step</h2>
        <p>Understanding AI is the first step toward using it responsibly. This knowledge helps you navigate AI capabilities and limitations effectively.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Laptop with AI \"Buzzword\" -->
                <rect x=\"150\" y=\"60\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"160\" y=\"70\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"130\" width=\"20\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#666666\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"180\" y=\"80\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"94\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Buzzword</text>
                
                <!-- AI as a tool illustration -->
                <rect x=\"170\" y=\"100\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Tools -->
                <path d=\"M165,105 L160,110 L165,115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path> <!-- Wrench -->
                <rect x=\"185\" y=\"103\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect> <!-- Nail -->
                <path d=\"M200,102 L205,110 L210,102 L200,102\" fill=\"#333333\"></path> <!-- Hammer head -->
                <line x1=\"205\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"205\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line> <!-- Hammer handle -->
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">AI is not just a buzzword, but a powerful tool with broad capabilities</p>
        </div>

        <h3>AI Literacy</h3>
        <p>AI literacy involves understanding the basic principles of how AI systems work, their capabilities, and their limitations. Key aspects include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Basic AI Concepts:</strong> Understanding that AI systems learn from data and make predictions based on patterns</li>
            <li><strong>Capabilities:</strong> Recognizing what AI can do well (pattern recognition, processing large datasets) and what it struggles with (nuanced understanding, creative thinking)</li>
            <li><strong>Limitations:</strong> Being aware that AI systems may reflect biases present in their training data</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>By staying informed about AI developments and participating in discussions about its ethical implications, you can make more informed decisions about how to use AI tools responsibly.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Going Beyond the Hype</h3>
            <p>When evaluating AI tools, look beyond marketing claims to understand what the technology actually does and how it works. Ask questions like:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>What kind of data does this AI use?</li>
                <li>How transparent is the AI system about its decision-making?</li>
                <li>What measures are in place to ensure fairness and prevent bias?</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"safety-privacy\">
        <h2>Safety and Privacy: Protecting Your Data</h2>
        <p>Your data is precious, and understanding how it is used by AI systems is crucial for maintaining privacy and security.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Safety First Sign -->
                <rect x=\"80\" y=\"60\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">SAFETY</text>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">FIRST</text>
                
                <!-- Cloud with icons -->
                <ellipse cx=\"250\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse>
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"65\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"230\" y=\"69\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">i</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"80\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"250\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">👁️</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"65\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"270\" y=\"69\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">→</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"80\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"290\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">🐞</text>
                
                <!-- Lock -->
                <rect x=\"170\" y=\"120\" width=\"60\" height=\"50\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"135\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"135\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Security and privacy should always be top priorities when using AI systems</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Data Privacy Best Practices</h3>
        <p>When interacting with AI systems, consider these privacy practices:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Understand Data Collection:</strong> Know what data is being collected and how it will be used</li>
            <li><strong>Choose Privacy-Focused Services:</strong> Select AI tools that prioritize user privacy</li>
            <li><strong>Regular Privacy Audits:</strong> Periodically review which AI services have access to your data</li>
            <li><strong>Use Privacy Features:</strong> Take advantage of privacy settings and features offered by AI services</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Microsoft\'s Approach to AI Privacy</h3>
            <p>Microsoft implements several measures to ensure data privacy in its AI services:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Prompts and responses in Copilot are discarded at the end of a session</li>
                <li>Your organization\'s data is not shared with third parties without permission</li>
                <li>Strict data governance policies protect personally identifiable information</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>Remember that your personal data should remain personal. Always review privacy policies before using new AI services, and be cautious about sharing sensitive information with AI systems unless you\'re confident in their security practices.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"ethical-use\">
        <h2>Ethical Use of AI Systems</h2>
        <p>Using AI ethically involves critically evaluating AI-generated content and ensuring AI is used for beneficial purposes.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Search input -->
                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"40\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"15\"></rect>
                <text x=\"120\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#666666\">Two people shaking hands</text>
                
                <!-- AI-generated image with errors -->
                <rect x=\"150\" y=\"80\" width=\"100\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Stylized handshake with errors (extra fingers) -->
                <ellipse cx=\"175\" cy=\"120\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></ellipse> <!-- Hand 1 -->
                <ellipse cx=\"225\" cy=\"120\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></ellipse> <!-- Hand 2 -->
                <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"225\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Extra fingers -->
                <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"185\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"172\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"177\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"225\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"225\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Critical thinking magnifying glass -->
                <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"150\" r=\"25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"275\" y1=\"165\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                <text x=\"260\" y=\"155\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Critical</text>
                <text x=\"260\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Thinking</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Critical thinking is essential when evaluating AI-generated content</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Critical Evaluation of AI Content</h3>
        <p>When using AI-generated content, it\'s important to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Verify Information:</strong> Cross-check facts from multiple sources</li>
            <li><strong>Be Aware of Limitations:</strong> Understand that AI can produce hallucinations or inaccuracies</li>
            <li><strong>Apply Human Judgment:</strong> Use your critical thinking skills to evaluate AI outputs</li>
            <li><strong>Consider Biases:</strong> Be aware that AI systems may reflect biases in their training data</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Five Steps to Tool Safety</h3>
            <p>To ensure ethical use of AI tools:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Use AI tools from reputable sources</li>
                <li>Stay informed about AI capabilities and limitations</li>
                <li>Verify critical information from multiple sources</li>
                <li>Use AI as a supplement to, not replacement for, human judgment</li>
                <li>Report harmful or biased AI behaviors to platform providers</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <h3>AI for Good</h3>
        <p>AI can be a powerful force for positive change. Examples include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Healthcare:</strong> Improving diagnostic accuracy and treatment plans</li>
            <li><strong>Education:</strong> Providing personalized learning experiences</li>
            <li><strong>Environmental Conservation:</strong> Monitoring wildlife and ecological systems</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Microsoft\'s AI for Good initiative exemplifies this approach, equipping individuals and organizations globally with AI capabilities to address humanitarian challenges and create a more sustainable and inclusive world.</p>
        
        <h3>Building a Responsible AI Future</h3>
        <p>Everyone has a role to play in ensuring AI is used responsibly:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Join the Conversation:</strong> Participate in discussions about AI ethics and policy</li>
            <li><strong>Advocate for Responsible Use:</strong> Encourage adoption of responsible AI practices in your community and workplace</li>
            <li><strong>Provide Feedback:</strong> Share your experiences to help improve AI systems</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>By working together to implement these best practices, we can shape an AI future that benefits humanity while minimizing potential harms. The responsible use of AI is not just a technical consideration but a shared social responsibility.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '424', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('26', '4', 'Chapter 4.25: Principles of Responsible AI', 'Foundational principles guiding ethical AI development and deployment', 'chapter2_25', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Responsible AI Principles</h2>
        <p>AI is all around us. It\'s there when you ask a voice assistant to play your favorite song, when a chatbot helps you with customer service, and when your navigation app guides you home. But have you ever wondered about the principles that guide the creation of these AI systems?</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"220\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 220\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Woman with laptop -->
                <ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"140\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse>
                <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"100\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M90,130 Q110,140 130,130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <!-- Laptop -->
                <rect x=\"80\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"85\" y=\"155\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></rect>
                <text x=\"110\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI</text>
                
                <!-- Musical notes -->
                <path d=\"M160,110 L165,100 L170,110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>
                <ellipse cx=\"162\" cy=\"110\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"167\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"172\" cy=\"110\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                
                <!-- Chat bubble -->
                <rect x=\"180\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <polygon points=\"185,155 190,145 200,155\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></polygon>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hello!</text>
                
                <!-- Map with route -->
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"100\" width=\"50\" height=\"80\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <ellipse cx=\"250\" cy=\"115\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"280\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M250,115 Q270,110 255,140 Q275,150 280,160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                
                <!-- Building blocks of principles -->
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"80\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"105\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"130\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"155\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"180\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">AI is integrated throughout our daily lives, making the principles that guide it crucial</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Building Trust in AI Systems</h3>
            <p>Responsible AI principles serve as the foundation for developing trustworthy AI systems. These principles guide the creation of AI that benefits humanity, respects individual rights, and operates transparently and fairly. When implemented effectively, these principles help ensure that AI technologies earn and maintain the trust of users and society.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>In this chapter, we\'ll explore the six core principles of responsible AI: accountability, inclusiveness, reliability and safety, fairness, transparency, and privacy and security. These principles work together to create a framework for developing and deploying AI systems that are beneficial, ethical, and aligned with human values.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"core-principles\">
        <h2>Core Principles of Responsible AI</h2>
        <p>The journey to responsible AI begins with trust, a trust that is built on six core principles. These principles guide the development, deployment, and governance of AI systems to ensure they benefit humanity.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"250\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 250\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Building blocks -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <text x=\"75\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Accountability</text>
                
                <rect x=\"105\" y=\"50\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Inclusiveness</text>
                
                <rect x=\"160\" y=\"50\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Reliability &amp; Safety</text>
                
                <rect x=\"245\" y=\"50\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <text x=\"270\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fairness</text>
                
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"50\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <text x=\"325\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Transparency</text>
                
                <rect x=\"175\" y=\"85\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Privacy</text>
                
                <!-- Structured tower with blocks -->
                <rect x=\"175\" y=\"120\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"175\" y=\"155\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"175\" y=\"190\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Trust label -->
                <text x=\"115\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333333\" font-weight=\"bold\">TRUST</text>
                <path d=\"M130,145 Q160,130 170,145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                <polygon points=\"170,145 165,138 160,146\" fill=\"#333333\"></polygon>
                
                <!-- Stack label -->
                <text x=\"240\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333333\" font-weight=\"bold\">PRINCIPLES</text>
                <path d=\"M230,170 Q210,170 200,170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                <polygon points=\"200,170 205,165 205,175\" fill=\"#333333\"></polygon>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The six core principles stack together to build trust in AI systems</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Accountability</h3>
        <p>Accountability is not just about creating AI systems, it\'s about taking responsibility for their impact.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 150\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- People cleaning environment (accountability in action) -->
                <ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"120\" rx=\"120\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.3\"></ellipse>
                
                <!-- People silhouettes -->
                <rect x=\"160\" y=\"70\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"60\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <rect x=\"200\" y=\"75\" width=\"10\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"65\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"210\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <rect x=\"240\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Litter -->
                <rect x=\"150\" y=\"110\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"105\" width=\"10\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"115\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" font-weight=\"bold\">Accountability</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Accountability means taking responsibility for AI systems and their impacts</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>In practice, accountability involves:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Clear Roles:</strong> Defining who is responsible for different aspects of AI systems</li>
            <li><strong>Impact Assessment:</strong> Evaluating the potential consequences of AI deployments</li>
            <li><strong>Governance:</strong> Establishing processes to ensure responsible development and use</li>
            <li><strong>Redress Mechanisms:</strong> Creating ways for people to seek recourse if harmed by AI systems</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Inclusiveness</h3>
        <p>Inclusiveness is about designing AI solutions with everyone in mind, ensuring that the benefits of AI are accessible to all.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 150\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Earth -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"75\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M160,50 Q200,30 240,50 Q260,75 240,100 Q200,120 160,100 Q140,75 160,50\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path>
                
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" font-weight=\"bold\">Inclusiveness</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Inclusiveness ensures AI benefits are accessible to people worldwide</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Inclusive AI development includes:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Diverse Teams:</strong> Involving people with varied backgrounds in AI creation</li>
            <li><strong>Universal Design:</strong> Creating AI that works for people of all abilities</li>
            <li><strong>Cultural Sensitivity:</strong> Respecting different cultural contexts and values</li>
            <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Ensuring AI interfaces can be used by people with disabilities</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Reliability and Safety</h3>
        <p>Reliability and safety are achieved through rigorous testing, validation, and continuous monitoring.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 150\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Person at computer -->
                <rect x=\"160\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"167\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Computer monitor -->
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"50\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"90\" width=\"50\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"95\" width=\"10\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Safety icons on screen -->
                <circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"65\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"205\" y=\"69\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓</text>
                
                <polygon points=\"225,55 235,75 215,75\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></polygon>
                <text x=\"225\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">!</text>
                
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" font-weight=\"bold\">Reliability &amp; Safety</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Safety measures ensure AI systems operate as intended and handle errors gracefully</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Safety and reliability measures include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Robust Testing:</strong> Verifying AI systems work properly in various scenarios</li>
            <li><strong>Fail-safes:</strong> Implementing mechanisms to prevent harm if systems malfunction</li>
            <li><strong>Error Handling:</strong> Designing systems to gracefully manage unexpected inputs</li>
            <li><strong>Security Protections:</strong> Safeguarding against attacks or unauthorized modifications</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Fairness</h3>
        <p>Fairness is about treating all individuals equitably and avoiding bias in AI systems.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 150\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Diverse group high-five -->
                <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"165\" y=\"75\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"65\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"195\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"225\" y=\"75\" width=\"10\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"185\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#FBD44B\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"205\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                <line x1=\"225\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line>
                
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" font-weight=\"bold\">Fairness</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Fairness means treating all individuals equitably regardless of their characteristics</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Building fair AI systems involves:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Bias Detection:</strong> Identifying and addressing biases in training data and algorithms</li>
            <li><strong>Equity Assessment:</strong> Evaluating whether AI systems provide equal benefits to different groups</li>
            <li><strong>Diverse Training Data:</strong> Using datasets that represent the full diversity of users</li>
            <li><strong>Regular Audits:</strong> Monitoring for disparate impacts as systems operate over time</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Transparency</h3>
        <p>Transparency is key to fostering trust. It allows users to understand AI decisions and outcomes.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 150\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Charts/graphs for transparency -->
                <rect x=\"170\" y=\"40\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"210\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <rect x=\"170\" y=\"90\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"110\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>
                
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" font-weight=\"bold\">Transparency</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Transparency makes AI decisions and processes understandable to users</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Transparency in AI includes:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Explainability:</strong> Making AI decision-making understandable to users</li>
            <li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Clearly describing how AI systems work and their limitations</li>
            <li><strong>Disclosure:</strong> Informing users when they are interacting with AI systems</li>
            <li><strong>Interpretability:</strong> Designing AI that can explain the reasoning behind its outputs</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Privacy and Security</h3>
        <p>Privacy and security are about respecting and protecting user data. Only necessary data is collected and users have control over their data.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 150\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Privacy fortress/shield -->
                <rect x=\"170\" y=\"40\" width=\"60\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"180\" y=\"40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <polygon points=\"170,40 200,20 230,40\" fill=\"#333333\"></polygon>
                
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"60\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></circle>
                
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" font-weight=\"bold\">Privacy &amp; Security</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Privacy and security protect sensitive data and user information</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Privacy and security practices include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Data Minimization:</strong> Collecting only the data needed for the AI system to function</li>
            <li><strong>User Control:</strong> Giving users choices about how their data is used</li>
            <li><strong>Secure Design:</strong> Building systems with security considerations from the start</li>
            <li><strong>Breach Protection:</strong> Implementing safeguards against unauthorized access</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"implementation\">
        <h2>Implementing Responsible AI Principles</h2>
        <p>Numerous tools and resources are available to aid in the development, deployment, and advancement of AI in alignment with responsible principles.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Toolbox -->
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"40\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.9\" rx=\"3\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Tools -->
                <rect x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"5\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"55\" y=\"60\" width=\"15\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"1\"></rect>
                
                <path d=\"M85,60 L80,65 L85,70 L90,65 Z\" fill=\"#333333\"></path>
                <rect x=\"85\" y=\"70\" width=\"3\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"60\" width=\"20\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"1\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"115\" y=\"65\" width=\"5\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"85\" width=\"40\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                
                <!-- AI system with tools -->
                <rect x=\"200\" y=\"40\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"275\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI System</text>
                <text x=\"275\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Developed with Responsible</text>
                <text x=\"275\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI Tools &amp; Resources</text>
                
                <!-- Connection -->
                <path d=\"M130,80 Q170,60 200,80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></path>
                <polygon points=\"200,80 190,75 190,85\" fill=\"#333333\"></polygon>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Tools and resources help implement responsible AI principles throughout development</p>
        </div>

        <p>Resources and tools can guide developers through the responsible evolution of AI technologies. They can assist with:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Error Identification:</strong> Finding mistakes and biases in AI systems</li>
            <li><strong>Fairness Assessment:</strong> Measuring equitable treatment across different groups</li>
            <li><strong>Data Exploration:</strong> Understanding the characteristics and limitations of training data</li>
            <li><strong>Decision Tracing:</strong> Examining how AI reaches specific conclusions</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Microsoft Copilot: Responsible AI in Practice</h3>
            <p>Microsoft Copilot exemplifies responsible AI practices through:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>User data privacy and control</li>
                <li>Context-aware suggestions with transparent reasoning</li>
                <li>Equitable design to assist all users fairly</li>
                <li>Rigorous testing for reliability and safety</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"continuous-improvement\">
        <h2>Continuous Improvement and Collaboration</h2>
        <p>The approach to developing AI is dynamic, not static. Continuous learning from experiences, user feedback, and advancements in the field are integral to improving AI systems and practices.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Rolling ball (dynamics) -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"140\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M50,140 Q75,100 150,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></path>
                
                <!-- Faces showing feedback -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"70\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"192\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"208\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M190,80 Q200,75 210,80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                
                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"70\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"242\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"258\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"70\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M290,85 Q300,80 310,85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(180, 300, 80)\"></path>
                
                <!-- Road ahead -->
                <rect x=\"180\" y=\"120\" width=\"170\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"></line>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Continuous improvement through feedback and adaptation is essential for responsible AI</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Collaborative Approach</h3>
        <p>Responsible AI development requires collaboration among various stakeholders:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Users:</strong> Providing feedback on their experiences with AI systems</li>
            <li><strong>Developers:</strong> Implementing ethical considerations throughout the development process</li>
            <li><strong>Policymakers:</strong> Creating frameworks that encourage responsible innovation</li>
            <li><strong>Researchers:</strong> Advancing methods for addressing AI challenges</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Legal and Regulatory Compliance</h3>
        <p>Responsible AI principles include compliance with:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Existing Laws:</strong> Data protection, privacy, anti-discrimination, and consumer protection</li>
            <li><strong>Emerging Regulations:</strong> AI-specific rules being developed around the world</li>
            <li><strong>Industry Standards:</strong> Best practices and voluntary guidelines for AI development</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>The Future of Responsible AI</h3>
            <p>As AI technology continues to evolve, so too will our approaches to ensuring it remains beneficial, fair, and aligned with human values. By embracing continuous improvement and maintaining a commitment to these six core principles, we can build AI systems that earn trust and serve humanity\'s best interests.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>', '425', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('27', '4', 'Chapter 4.26: Deepfakes and Copyright in AI', 'Understanding emerging challenges in AI content authenticity and ownership', 'chapter3_26', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"deepfakes\">
        <h2>Understanding Deepfakes</h2>
        <p>Imagine you\'re scrolling through your mobile phone, and you come across a video of a famous person saying something controversial. You\'re taken aback, but then you remember—it could be a deepfake.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Woman with phone shocked expression -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"90\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"115\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse>
                
                <!-- Smartphone -->
                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"135\" width=\"60\" height=\"35\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"75\" y=\"140\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"172\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Man with phone approving expression -->
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"290\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"310\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M290,110 Q300,120 310,110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <!-- Smartphone -->
                <rect x=\"270\" y=\"135\" width=\"60\" height=\"35\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"275\" y=\"140\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"172\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Exclamation mark speech bubble -->
                <ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M135,90 L145,80\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#FB4B4B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <text x=\"150\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">!</text>
                
                <!-- Question mark speech bubble -->
                <ellipse cx=\"250\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M265,90 L255,80\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <text x=\"250\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">?</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Deepfakes can elicit strong reactions, from shock to confusion to false acceptance</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>What is a Deepfake?</h3>
            <p>A deepfake is a fraudulent piece of content—typically audio or video—that has been manipulated or created using artificial intelligence. Deepfakes use advanced AI techniques to replace a real person\'s voice, image, or both with eerily similar artificial likenesses.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>This technology has made it increasingly challenging to discern if something you see or hear on the internet is real. As AI technology advances, deepfakes are becoming more sophisticated and harder to detect with the naked eye.</p>
        
        <h3>How Deepfakes Work</h3>
        <p>Deepfakes use advanced AI techniques to create or manipulate content:</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Person with AI overlay -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"85\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"115\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M85,115 Q100,125 115,115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <!-- AI overlay -->
                <g opacity=\"0.5\">
                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"110\" y=\"80\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></rect>
                    
                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"90\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"90\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"90\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"110\" y=\"90\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                    
                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"100\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"100\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"100\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\"></rect>
                    <rect x=\"110\" y=\"100\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></rect>
                </g>
                
                <!-- Percentage indicators -->
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Original</text>
                
                <!-- Arrow -->
                <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <polygon points=\"200,100 195,95 195,105\" fill=\"#333333\"></polygon>
                
                <!-- Sound wave -->
                <path d=\"M230,80 L230,120 M240,70 L240,130 M250,60 L250,140 M260,75 L260,125 M270,85 L270,115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                
                <!-- Points on face -->
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"285\" cy=\"90\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"90\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"90\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"100\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"100\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"115\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"115\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"115\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\"></circle>
                
                <line x1=\"285\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"285\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                <line x1=\"315\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#6E4BFB\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line>
                
                <text x=\"300\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Manipulated</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Deepfakes analyze facial features and voice patterns to create convincing manipulations</p>
        </div>
        
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Facial Recognition and Mapping:</strong> They analyze facial features and movements to create a digital mask</li>
            <li><strong>Voice Synthesis:</strong> They can replicate voice patterns to create artificial speech</li>
            <li><strong>Movement Analysis:</strong> They replicate body movements and gestures for realistic animation</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Potential Harms of Deepfakes</h3>
        <p>Deepfakes are frequently used for harmful purposes, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Misinformation:</strong> Creating false narratives that can influence public opinion</li>
            <li><strong>Election Manipulation:</strong> Falsely depicting candidates saying or doing things</li>
            <li><strong>Social Engineering:</strong> Creating convincing impersonations to gain trust</li>
            <li><strong>Fraud:</strong> Impersonating individuals for financial or other gains</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"combating-deepfakes\">
        <h2>Combating Deepfakes</h2>
        <p>Recognizing the urgent need to combat deepfakes, the tech sector, including companies involved in AI model creation and consumer services like Microsoft, is taking action.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Fighter vs mask -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"90\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M95,105 Q100,110 105,105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <!-- Body -->
                <rect x=\"90\" y=\"130\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"85\" y=\"130\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Leg kicking -->
                <path d=\"M110,160 L150,130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4B6EFB\" stroke-width=\"5\"></path>
                <ellipse cx=\"155\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></ellipse>
                
                <!-- Mask being kicked -->
                <path d=\"M170,100 Q200,80 230,100 Q240,120 230,140 Q200,160 170,140 Q160,120 170,100\" fill=\"#333333\" opacity=\"0.8\"></path>
                <ellipse cx=\"185\" cy=\"115\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"215\" cy=\"115\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></ellipse>
                
                <!-- Tech sector collaboration -->
                <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"310\" y=\"90\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"330\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TECH</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#6E4BFB\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"130\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"130\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">The tech sector is collaborating to combat deepfakes through various methods</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Key Strategies Against Deepfakes</h3>
        <p>Several approaches are being developed to detect and prevent harmful deepfakes:</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Industry Approaches to Combating Deepfakes</h3>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Building a Safe Environment:</strong> Implementing safety measures, constant monitoring, and quick action against misuse</li>
                <li><strong>Content Credentials:</strong> Adding special marks or digital watermarks to AI-created content</li>
                <li><strong>Platform Safety:</strong> Spotting and removing harmful content from online platforms</li>
                <li><strong>Collaborative Efforts:</strong> Tech companies, non-profits, and governments working together</li>
                <li><strong>Regulatory Updates:</strong> Developing new laws and initiatives to protect people</li>
                <li><strong>Public Education:</strong> Helping people identify authentic versus fake content</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Detection Technologies</h3>
        <p>While deepfakes pose ethical and security concerns, AI technology is also making strides in detection:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>AI-Powered Detection:</strong> Machine learning models trained to identify visual artifacts</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Watermarking:</strong> Embedding invisible markers in authentic content</li>
            <li><strong>Blockchain Verification:</strong> Creating immutable records of original content</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>As detection technology improves, it\'s becoming easier to identify deepfakes. However, the technology behind creating deepfakes is also advancing rapidly, making it an ongoing challenge.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"copyright\">
        <h2>Copyright in the Age of AI</h2>
        <p>The rise and awareness of AI-generated content leads us to another significant topic—copyright protection in the AI era.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Person examining art/content -->
                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"100\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"115\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"95\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M115,105 Q120,110 125,105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <!-- Arm pointing -->
                <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Frame with art/content -->
                <rect x=\"180\" y=\"60\" width=\"100\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <text x=\"230\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">©</text>
                
                <!-- Copyright law document -->
                <rect x=\"320\" y=\"80\" width=\"50\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <text x=\"335\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Copyright</text>
                <text x=\"335\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Law</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Copyright law confronts new challenges in the era of AI-generated content</p>
        </div>

        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>Understanding Copyright</h3>
            <p>Copyright is a legal concept that grants creators and authors of original work exclusive rights to its use and distribution, ensuring they receive recognition and financial benefit from their creations. But what happens when the creator is an AI service or tool?</p>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Key Copyright Questions in AI</h3>
        <p>AI-generated content raises several important copyright questions:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Ownership:</strong> Who owns AI-generated content—the user, the AI developer, or no one?</li>
            <li><strong>Training Data:</strong> How should copyright apply to data used to train AI models?</li>
            <li><strong>Derivative Works:</strong> Are AI-generated works based on existing content considered derivatives?</li>
            <li><strong>Creativity Standard:</strong> Does AI-generated work meet the creativity requirements for copyright?</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Microsoft\'s Copilot Copyright Commitment</h3>
        <p>Knowing that copyright is an important issue to address for AI-generated content, initiatives such as the Microsoft Copilot Copyright Commitment were created to extend existing intellectual property security support to commercial Copilot services.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Copilot Logo -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"90\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Copilot</text>
                
                <!-- Padlock and copyright -->
                <rect x=\"180\" cy=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"195\" y=\"70\" width=\"10\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                
                <text x=\"200\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">©</text>
                <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <!-- Flow chart -->
                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <text x=\"295\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">💻</text>
                
                <line x1=\"295\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"295\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <text x=\"295\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">📝</text>
                
                <line x1=\"295\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"295\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <circle cx=\"295\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <text x=\"295\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓</text>
                
                <rect x=\"340\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <text x=\"355\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">👤</text>
                
                <line x1=\"355\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"355\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <rect x=\"340\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <text x=\"355\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">🖼️</text>
                
                <line x1=\"355\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"355\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <circle cx=\"355\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <text x=\"355\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓</text>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Microsoft\'s Copilot Copyright Commitment protects users from copyright infringement claims</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>This commitment addresses potential IP infringement liability that could arise from the use of the output of Microsoft\'s Copilots and Azure OpenAI Service. It provides protection for customers by assuming responsibility for potential legal risks related to copyright claims.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"protection-measures\">
        <h2>Protection Measures for Content Integrity</h2>
        <p>To further build trust in AI-generated content, various protection measures are being developed and implemented.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Certificate/Guarantee -->
                <rect x=\"80\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <ellipse cx=\"130\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.3\"></ellipse>
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"63\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GUARANTEE</text>
                <text x=\"130\" y=\"73\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\">QUALITY</text>
                
                <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Verification icons -->
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"80\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4BFB9D\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                <text x=\"230\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓</text>
                
                <rect x=\"210\" y=\"120\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"5\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"215\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"130\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FB4B4B\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>
                
                <!-- Charts/graphs -->
                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"340\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"350\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- People smiling with phones -->
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"130\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"295\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"305\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M295,135 Q300,140 305,135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"130\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"345\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"355\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <path d=\"M345,135 Q350,140 355,135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                
                <rect x=\"290\" y=\"150\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"340\" y=\"150\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\" rx=\"2\"></rect>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Content credentials and verification tools help establish trust in digital content</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Content Credentials</h3>
        <p>To further build trust in AI-generated content, Microsoft has developed content credentials. This feature uses cryptographic methods to add an invisible digital watermark to all AI-generated images in Bing, including the time and date it was originally created.</p>
        
        <div class=\"info-box\">
            <h3>Benefits of Content Credentials</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Provenance:</strong> Helps determine where content comes from</li>
                <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> Provides a way to verify content authenticity</li>
                <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Gives creators and users better tools to decide what to trust</li>
                <li><strong>Protection:</strong> Safeguards against unauthorized use or manipulation</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Staying Informed and Vigilant</h3>
        <p>As consumers of digital content, we all have a responsibility to approach what we see online with a critical eye. Remember:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Question Sources:</strong> Consider where content is coming from and its credibility</li>
            <li><strong>Look for Verification:</strong> Check if content has been verified or contains digital credentials</li>
            <li><strong>Be Skeptical:</strong> Not everything you see or hear may be the truth</li>
            <li><strong>Report Suspicious Content:</strong> Help platforms identify potential deepfakes</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"180\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 180\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Woman shocked at phone -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"90\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <ellipse cx=\"90\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></ellipse>
                <ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></ellipse>
                
                <!-- Phone -->
                <rect x=\"80\" y=\"120\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <rect x=\"85\" y=\"125\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Scales of justice -->
                <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                <rect x=\"190\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"115\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"115\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                
                <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>
                
                <!-- Magnifying glass and lightbulb -->
                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"90\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <line x1=\"315\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>
                
                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"70\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FBD44B\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"348\" y=\"85\" width=\"4\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#333333\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Ear and sound waves -->
                <path d=\"M350,120 Q360,110 360,125 Q350,140 340,125 Q340,110 350,120\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M365,115 Q370,120 375,115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M365,120 Q370,125 375,120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
                <path d=\"M365,125 Q370,130 375,125\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>
            </svg>
            <p class=\"caption\">Stay vigilant and informed about the content you encounter online</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>When it comes to AI-generated content, it\'s important to know your rights and the measures in place to protect them. By staying informed and approaching digital content with a critical eye, you can help promote a more trustworthy digital environment.</p>
    </section>
</div>', '426', '15', '1', '2025-11-04 14:58:16', '2025-11-04 14:58:16');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `subtitle`, `slug`, `content`, `order_index`, `duration_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('28', '4', 'Chapter 4.27: Human-AI Interaction and Global Implications', 'Understanding the societal impact of human-AI relationships', 'chapter4_27', '<div class=\"chapter-content\">
    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"introduction\">
        <h2>Introduction to Human-AI Interaction</h2>
        <p>AI is transforming industries by facilitating decisions based on data, streamlining processes through automation, and fostering new innovations. But its impact extends beyond efficiency—it\'s also contributing to a more inclusive society.</p>
        
        <div class=\"image-container\">
            <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewbox=\"0 0 400 200\">
                <!-- Background -->
                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F9F9FF\" rx=\"10\"></rect>
                
                <!-- Automatic button -->
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <rect x=\"75\" y=\"95\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4B6EFB\" opacity=\"0.8\"></rect>
                <text x=\"100\" y=\"103\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AUTOMATIC</text>
                
                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                <path d=\"M93,100 L107,100\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>
                
                <!-- Gears -->
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>
                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"></circle>
                
