        <div class=\"key-concept\">
            <h3>AI as a Force for Inclusion</h3>
            <p>AI has the potential to create a more inclusive world by helping individuals with low vision interpret images, supporting farmers in sustainable agriculture, and providing personalized learning experiences. While these applications bring tremendous benefits, we must ensure that human-AI interactions are conducted responsibly, with the well-being of all in mind.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>As AI becomes more integrated into our daily workflows and decision-making processes, understanding the dynamics of human-AI interaction becomes increasingly important. This chapter explores key considerations, global implications, and principles for fostering beneficial relationships between humans and AI systems.</p>
    </section>

    <section class=\"content-section\" id=\"key-considerations\">
        <h2>Key Considerations in Human-AI Interaction</h2>
        <p>Let\'s dive into some key considerations on this topic, starting with the foundation of all AI systems: data.</p>
        
